window.BUZZ_COURSE_V2_LESSONS = Object.assign(window.BUZZ_COURSE_V2_LESSONS || {}, {"integration-by-parts":{"id":"integration-by-parts","prerequisites":["product-rule","u-sub-basic","ftc-part2"],"next":["ibp-poly-exp"],"related":["ibp-log-invtrig","ibp-cyclic"],"objectives":["從乘法法則推出 $\\int u\\,dv=uv-\\int v\\,du$","會挑 $u$ 與 $dv$：$u$ 微分後變簡單，$dv$ 積得出來","會做定積分版本：$\\int_a^b u\\,dv=[uv]_a^b-\\int_a^b v\\,du$"],"concept":[{"heading":"① 乘法法則倒過來","body":["換元積不出來的乘積：","$x$ 不是裡面那層的導數，換元不行","乘法法則：","兩邊積分（左邊積回 $uv$）：","常數 $C$ 先不寫，最後的積分會帶","移項：","簡寫：$dv=v'\\,dx$、$du=u'\\,dx$","「分部」：把被積函數分成兩部分，$u$ 與 $dv$","口訣：一個微分、一個積分"],"tex":["\\int x e^{-x}\\,dx","\\big(uv\\big)'=u'v+uv'","uv=\\int u'v\\,dx+\\int uv'\\,dx","\\int uv'\\,dx=uv-\\int u'v\\,dx","\\int u\\,dv=uv-\\int v\\,du"]},{"heading":"② 它做了什麼交換","body":["左邊：$u$ 乘 $dv$　→　右邊：$v$ 乘 $du$","$\\int x e^{-x}dx$：$u=x$、$dv=e^{-x}dx$","$v$ 是 $dv$ 的反導函數，挑一個就好（⑤ 說為什麼）","代公式：","新的積分沒有 $x$ 了，直接積：","檢查：$\\big[-(x+1)e^{-x}\\big]'=-e^{-x}+(x+1)e^{-x}=xe^{-x}$"],"tex":["du=dx,\\qquad v=-e^{-x}","\\int x e^{-x}dx=-xe^{-x}-\\int(-e^{-x})\\,dx","=-xe^{-x}-e^{-x}+C=-(x+1)e^{-x}+C"]},{"heading":"② 再一例：$\\int x\\sin 2x\\,dx$","body":["$u=x$、$dv=\\sin 2x\\,dx$","反連鎖律：裡面是 $2x$，積完要除以 $2$","最常錯的兩個地方：$v$ 的負號、兩次除以 $2$","挑 $u$ 的原則：","• $u$：微分後變簡單（多項式會降次）","• $dv$：積得出來"],"tex":["du=dx,\\qquad v=-\\tfrac12\\cos 2x","\\int x\\sin2x\\,dx=-\\tfrac12x\\cos2x+\\tfrac12\\int\\cos2x\\,dx","=-\\tfrac12x\\cos2x+\\tfrac14\\sin2x+C"]},{"heading":"③ 挑錯會怎樣","body":["反過來挑：$u=e^{-x}$、$dv=x\\,dx$","多項式升了一次：越做越難","等式是對的，只是沒用；看到新積分變難，就回頭換一種拆法"],"tex":["du=-e^{-x}dx,\\qquad v=\\tfrac12x^2","\\int xe^{-x}dx=\\tfrac12x^2e^{-x}+\\tfrac12\\int x^2e^{-x}dx"]},{"heading":"④ 定積分版本","body":["從 $(uv)'=u'v+uv'$ 在 $[a,b]$ 上積分（基本定理）：","$[uv]_a^b=u(b)v(b)-u(a)v(a)$","邊界項 $uv$ 直接代上下限，不用再積","例：$\\displaystyle\\int_0^\\pi x\\cos x\\,dx$，$u=x$、$v=\\sin x$","邊界項：$\\pi\\sin\\pi-0=0$","負的合理嗎？$x\\cos x$ 在 $(\\frac\\pi2,\\pi)$ 是負的，而且 $x$ 比較大，負的部分贏"],"tex":["\\int_a^b u\\,dv=\\Big[uv\\Big]_a^b-\\int_a^b v\\,du","=\\Big[x\\sin x\\Big]_0^\\pi-\\int_0^\\pi\\sin x\\,dx","\\int_0^\\pi\\sin x\\,dx=\\Big[-\\cos x\\Big]_0^\\pi=1-(-1)=2","\\int_0^\\pi x\\cos x\\,dx=0-2=-2"]},{"heading":"④ 圖上看：兩塊面積","body":["藍 ＋ 紅 ＝ 大長方形 － 灰色","紅的難算，就改算藍的","圖上 $u$、$v$ 都遞增；一般情形面積帶正負號，公式一樣成立"],"tex":["\\int_a^b u\\,dv+\\int_a^b v\\,du=\\Big[uv\\Big]_a^b"]},{"heading":"⑤ $v$ 為什麼不用加 $C$","body":["如果用 $v+C$ 代替 $v$：","$\\int C\\,du=Cu$（常數放到最後一起寫）","常數只在最後寫一次"],"tex":["u(v+C)-\\int(v+C)\\,du","=uv+Cu-\\int v\\,du-Cu","=uv-\\int v\\,du"]},{"heading":"重點整理","body":["• 乘法法則倒過來：$\\int u\\,dv=uv-\\int v\\,du$","• 交換：$u$ 被微分、$v$ 被積分","• $u$ 選微分後變簡單的（多項式），$dv$ 選積得出來的","• 挑錯不會算錯，但新積分會變難：換一種拆法","• 定積分：$[uv]_a^b-\\int_a^b v\\,du$，邊界項直接代","• $v$ 不加 $C$，最後再加一次","下一課：多項式 × 指數"]}],"workedExamples":[{"title":"多項式 $\\times$ 指數","prompt":"$\\int x e^{-x}\\,dx$","steps":["$u=x$（微分變 $1$），$dv=e^{-x}\\,dx$（積得出來）。","$du=dx$，$v=-e^{-x}$。","$\\int x e^{-x}\\,dx=x(-e^{-x})-\\int (-e^{-x})\\,dx=-x e^{-x}+\\int e^{-x}\\,dx$。","$=-x e^{-x}-e^{-x}+C$。","檢查：$(-x e^{-x}-e^{-x})'=-e^{-x}+x e^{-x}+e^{-x}=x e^{-x}$。"],"answer":"$-x e^{-x}-e^{-x}+C$"},{"title":"多項式 $\\times$ 三角","prompt":"$\\int x\\sin 2x\\,dx$","steps":["$u=x$，$dv=\\sin 2x\\,dx$。$du=dx$，$v=-\\frac{1}{2}\\cos 2x$。","$\\int x\\sin 2x\\,dx=-\\frac{x}{2}\\cos 2x-\\int \\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\cos 2x\\right)dx=-\\frac{x}{2}\\cos 2x+\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\cos 2x\\,dx$。","$=-\\frac{x}{2}\\cos 2x+\\frac{1}{4}\\sin 2x+C$。"],"answer":"$-\\frac{x}{2}\\cos 2x+\\frac{1}{4}\\sin 2x+C$"},{"title":"定積分","prompt":"$\\int_0^\\pi x\\cos x\\,dx$","steps":["$u=x$，$dv=\\cos x\\,dx$。$du=dx$，$v=\\sin x$。","$\\int_0^\\pi x\\cos x\\,dx=[x\\sin x]_0^\\pi-\\int_0^\\pi \\sin x\\,dx$。","$[x\\sin x]_0^\\pi=\\pi\\cdot 0-0=0$；$\\int_0^\\pi \\sin x\\,dx=[-\\cos x]_0^\\pi=1+1=2$。","答案：$0-2=-2$。是負的：$x\\cos x$ 在 $(\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\pi)$ 為負，那一段的面積比 $(0,\\frac{\\pi}{2})$ 那一段大。"],"answer":"$-2$"}],"pitfalls":["公式中間寫成加號：$uv+\\int v\\,du$。","$du$ 算錯：$u=x$ 時 $du=dx$，新積分裡不會再有 $x$。","挑反了 $u$ 和 $dv$，積分越做越難還繼續做。","定積分時 $uv$ 那一項忘了代上下限。"],"voice":"d9a4caa4","sections":[{"title":"乘法法則倒過來","beats":[{"show":["換元積不出來的乘積：","$\\int x e^{-x}\\,dx$"],"say":"先看一個積分：x 乘上 e 的負 x 次方。這是兩個函數相乘，而且 x 不是 e 的負 x 次方裡面那層的導數，換元用不上。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"換元積不出來的乘積："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int x e^{-x}\\,dx$","on":"而且"}],"t":[4840,17640]},{"show":["$x$ 不是裡面那層的導數，換元不行"],"say":"換元是連鎖律倒過來。乘積的積分，要找的是乘法法則倒過來。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$x$ 不是裡面那層的導數，換元不行","color":"red"}],"t":[17640,26350]},{"show":["乘法法則：","$\\big(uv\\big)'=u'v+uv'$"],"say":"回想乘法法則：u 乘 v 的導數，等於 u prime 乘 v，加上 u 乘 v prime。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"乘法法則："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\big(uv\\big)'=u'v+uv'$","on":"ri#1"}],"t":[26350,37640]},{"show":["兩邊積分（左邊積回 $uv$）：","$uv=\\int u'v\\,dx+\\int uv'\\,dx$"],"say":"兩邊同時積分。左邊是一個導數，積回去就是 u 乘 v 本身。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"兩邊積分（左邊積回 $uv$）："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle uv=\\int u'v\\,dx+\\int uv'\\,dx$","on":"一個"},{"do":"write","line":"　常數 $C$ 先不寫，最後的積分會帶","color":"violet","on":"本身"}],"t":[37640,46540]},{"show":["移項：","$\\int uv'\\,dx=uv-\\int u'v\\,dx$"],"say":"把其中一項移到另一邊，就得到 u 乘 v prime 的積分，等於 u v 減掉 u prime 乘 v 的積分。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"移項："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int uv'\\,dx=uv-\\int u'v\\,dx$","on":"積分#1"}],"t":[46540,59870]},{"show":["簡寫：$dv=v'\\,dx$、$du=u'\\,dx$","$\\int u\\,dv=uv-\\int v\\,du$"],"say":"把 v prime d x 寫成 d v，u prime d x 寫成 d u，就是分部積分公式：積分 u d v，等於 u v 減積分 v d u。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"簡寫：$dv=v'\\,dx$、$du=u'\\,dx$"},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx1:\\displaystyle \\int u\\,dv=uv-\\int v\\,du}}$","color":"red","on":"pr#2"},{"do":"box","term":"bx1","color":"red","on":"就是"},{"do":"write","line":"　「分部」：把被積函數分成兩部分，$u$ 與 $dv$","color":"violet","on":"等於"}],"t":[59870,75270]},{"show":["口訣：一個微分、一個積分"],"say":"用的時候，被積函數拆成兩塊：一塊叫 u，等一下要微分；另一塊叫 d v，等一下要積分。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"口訣：一個微分、一個積分","color":"gold"}],"t":[75270,85310]}]},{"title":"它做了什麼交換","beats":[{"show":["左邊：$u$ 乘 $dv$　→　右邊：$v$ 乘 $du$"],"say":"公式做的事，是一個交換：原本是 u 乘 d v，換成 v 乘 d u。u 被微分，v 被積出來。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"左邊：$u$ 乘 $dv$　→　右邊：$v$ 乘 $du$"}],"t":[85310,96880]},{"show":["$\\int x e^{-x}dx$：$u=x$、$dv=e^{-x}dx$","$du=dx,\\qquad v=-e^{-x}$"],"say":"回到開頭的例子。令 u 等於 x，d v 等於 e 的負 x 次方 d x。x 微分變成 1，e 的負 x 次方積分是負 e 的負 x 次方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\int x e^{-x}dx$：$u=x$、$dv=e^{-x}dx$"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle du=dx,\\qquad v=-e^{-x}$","on":"的負#1"},{"do":"write","line":"　$v$ 是 $dv$ 的反導函數，挑一個就好（⑤ 說為什麼）","color":"violet","on":"的負#2"}],"t":[96880,112630]},{"show":["代公式：","$\\int x e^{-x}dx=-xe^{-x}-\\int(-e^{-x})\\,dx$"],"say":"代進公式：u v 是負 x 乘 e 的負 x 次方，再減掉 v d u 的積分。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"代公式："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int x e^{-x}dx=-xe^{-x}-\\int(-e^{-x})\\,dx$","on":"次方"}],"t":[112630,123280]},{"show":["新的積分沒有 $x$ 了，直接積：","$=-xe^{-x}-e^{-x}+C=-(x+1)e^{-x}+C$"],"say":"關鍵在這裡：x 被微分成 1，新的積分只剩 e 的負 x 次方，一下就積出來。整理成負的 x 加 1，乘 e 的負 x 次方，加 C。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"新的積分沒有 $x$ 了，直接積："},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx2:\\displaystyle =-xe^{-x}-e^{-x}+C=-(x+1)e^{-x}+C}}$","on":"的負#1"},{"do":"box","term":"bx2","on":"的負#2"}],"t":[123280,137080]},{"show":["檢查：$\\big[-(x+1)e^{-x}\\big]'=-e^{-x}+(x+1)e^{-x}=xe^{-x}$"],"say":"微分檢查：負 e 的負 x 次方，加上 x 加 1 乘 e 的負 x 次方，剛好剩 x 乘 e 的負 x 次方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"檢查：$\\big[-(x+1)e^{-x}\\big]'=-e^{-x}+(x+1)e^{-x}=xe^{-x}$"}],"t":[137080,148680]}],"predict":{"ask":"$\\displaystyle\\int x e^{x}\\,dx$ 應該怎麼拆？","options":[{"label":"$u=x$，$dv=e^x dx$","correct":true},{"label":"$u=e^x$，$dv=x\\,dx$","why":"$x$ 積分變 $\\frac{x^2}2$，次方升高，越做越難"},{"label":"$u=xe^x$，$dv=dx$","why":"$u$ 微分還是乘積，等於沒拆"}]}},{"title":"再一例：$\\int x\\sin 2x\\,dx$","beats":[{"show":["$u=x$、$dv=\\sin 2x\\,dx$","$du=dx,\\qquad v=-\\tfrac12\\cos 2x$"],"say":"再一個例子：x 乘正弦 2x。一樣讓 x 當 u。正弦 2x 積分，是負 2 分之 1 餘弦 2x，別忘了除以 2。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$u=x$、$dv=\\sin 2x\\,dx$"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle du=dx,\\qquad v=-\\tfrac12\\cos 2x$","on":"正弦#2"},{"do":"write","line":"　反連鎖律：裡面是 $2x$，積完要除以 $2$","color":"violet","on":"分之"}],"t":[160000,172000]},{"show":["$\\int x\\sin2x\\,dx=-\\tfrac12x\\cos2x+\\tfrac12\\int\\cos2x\\,dx$"],"say":"代公式：u v 是負 2 分之 1 x 餘弦 2x。減掉 v d u，負負得正，變成加 2 分之 1 積分餘弦 2x。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int x\\sin2x\\,dx=-\\tfrac12x\\cos2x+\\tfrac12\\int\\cos2x\\,dx$"}],"t":[172000,184900]},{"show":["$=-\\tfrac12x\\cos2x+\\tfrac14\\sin2x+C$"],"say":"餘弦 2x 積分是 2 分之 1 正弦 2x，再乘前面的 2 分之 1，得到 4 分之 1 正弦 2x。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx3:\\displaystyle =-\\tfrac12x\\cos2x+\\tfrac14\\sin2x+C}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx3","color":"red","on":"正弦#1"},{"do":"write","line":"　最常錯的兩個地方：$v$ 的負號、兩次除以 $2$","color":"violet","on":"得到"}],"t":[184900,198630]},{"show":["挑 $u$ 的原則：","• $u$：微分後變簡單（多項式會降次）"],"say":"所以挑法的原則有兩條：u 要選微分以後變簡單的，例如多項式；d v 要選你積得出來的。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"挑 $u$ 的原則："},{"do":"write","line":"• $u$：微分後變簡單（多項式會降次）","on":"選微"},{"do":"write","line":"• $dv$：積得出來","on":"要選#2"}],"t":[198630,210370]}]},{"title":"挑錯會怎樣","beats":[{"show":["反過來挑：$u=e^{-x}$、$dv=x\\,dx$","$du=-e^{-x}dx,\\qquad v=\\tfrac12x^2$"],"say":"如果反過來，讓 e 的負 x 次方當 u，x d x 當 d v 呢？x 積分變成 2 分之 1 x 平方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"反過來挑：$u=e^{-x}$、$dv=x\\,dx$"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle du=-e^{-x}dx,\\qquad v=\\tfrac12x^2$","on":"積分"}],"t":[210370,221570]},{"show":["$\\int xe^{-x}dx=\\tfrac12x^2e^{-x}+\\tfrac12\\int x^2e^{-x}dx$"],"say":"代公式，新的積分變成 x 平方乘 e 的負 x 次方。次方從 1 變成 2，比原來還難。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int xe^{-x}dx=\\tfrac12x^2e^{-x}+\\tfrac12\\int x^2e^{-x}dx$"}],"t":[221570,230820]},{"show":["多項式升了一次：越做越難"],"say":"公式本身沒有錯，等號也成立，只是把題目變難了。挑錯不會算錯，只是會卡住。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"多項式升了一次：越做越難","color":"red"},{"do":"write","line":"　等式是對的，只是沒用；看到新積分變難，就回頭換一種拆法","color":"violet","on":"目變"}],"t":[230820,241060]}],"check":0},{"title":"定積分版本","beats":[{"show":["從 $(uv)'=u'v+uv'$ 在 $[a,b]$ 上積分（基本定理）：","$\\int_a^b u\\,dv=\\Big[uv\\Big]_a^b-\\int_a^b v\\,du$"],"say":"定積分版本：把乘法法則從 a 積到 b。用微積分基本定理，左邊變成 u v 在 b 減在 a。移項就得到這個公式。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"從 $(uv)'=u'v+uv'$ 在 $[a,b]$ 上積分（基本定理）："},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx4:\\displaystyle \\int_a^b u\\,dv=\\Big[uv\\Big]_a^b-\\int_a^b v\\,du}}$","on":"積到"},{"do":"box","term":"bx4","on":"左邊"},{"do":"write","line":"　$[uv]_a^b=u(b)v(b)-u(a)v(a)$","color":"violet","on":"減在"}],"t":[253790,265910]},{"show":["邊界項 $uv$ 直接代上下限，不用再積"],"say":"跟不定積分的差別只有一個：u v 那一項直接代上下限。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"邊界項 $uv$ 直接代上下限，不用再積"}],"t":[265910,271850]},{"show":["例：$\\displaystyle\\int_0^\\pi x\\cos x\\,dx$，$u=x$、$v=\\sin x$"],"say":"例子：x 乘餘弦 x，從 0 積到派。u 等於 x，v 等於正弦 x。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"例：$\\displaystyle\\int_0^\\pi x\\cos x\\,dx$，$u=x$、$v=\\sin x$"}],"t":[271850,280310]},{"show":["$=\\Big[x\\sin x\\Big]_0^\\pi-\\int_0^\\pi\\sin x\\,dx$"],"say":"代公式：邊界項是 x 乘正弦 x 從 0 到派，再減掉正弦 x 從 0 到派的積分。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle =\\Big[x\\sin x\\Big]_0^\\pi-\\int_0^\\pi\\sin x\\,dx$"}],"t":[280310,290480]},{"show":["邊界項：$\\pi\\sin\\pi-0=0$","$\\int_0^\\pi\\sin x\\,dx=\\Big[-\\cos x\\Big]_0^\\pi=1-(-1)=2$"],"say":"正弦派是 0，所以邊界項是 0。正弦從 0 到派的積分是 2。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"邊界項：$\\pi\\sin\\pi-0=0$"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int_0^\\pi\\sin x\\,dx=\\Big[-\\cos x\\Big]_0^\\pi=1-(-1)=2$","on":"正弦#2"}],"t":[290480,297940]},{"show":["$\\int_0^\\pi x\\cos x\\,dx=0-2=-2$"],"say":"答案是 0 減 2，等於負 2。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx5:\\displaystyle \\int_0^\\pi x\\cos x\\,dx=0-2=-2}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx5","color":"red","on":"等於"},{"do":"write","line":"　負的合理嗎？$x\\cos x$ 在 $(\\frac\\pi2,\\pi)$ 是負的，而且 $x$ 比較大，負的部分贏","color":"violet","on":"於負"}],"t":[297940,302450]}]},{"title":"圖上看：兩塊面積","beats":[{"show":["圖"],"say":"用圖來看。橫軸是 u，縱軸是 v。藍色是曲線下面的面積，就是積分 v d u；紅色是曲線左邊的面積，就是積分 u d v。","board":[{"do":"plot","svg":"<svg viewBox=\"0 0 620 300\" width=\"620\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"60\" y=\"196\" width=\"120\" height=\"64\" fill=\"var(--muted)\" fill-opacity=\"0.1\"/><path d=\"M180,260 L180,196 C280,190 330,80 420,52 L420,260 Z\" fill=\"var(--blue)\" fill-opacity=\"0.1\"/><path d=\"M60,196 L180,196 C280,190 330,80 420,52 L60,52 Z\" fill=\"var(--red)\" fill-opacity=\"0.1\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"260\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"260\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"20\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M180,196 C280,190 330,80 420,52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"196\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/><line x1=\"420\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"52\" stroke=\"var(--ink)\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/><text x=\"510\" y=\"265\" style=\"font-family:KaTeX_Math,serif;font-style:italic;font-size:20px\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">u</text><text x=\"52\" y=\"14\" style=\"font-family:KaTeX_Math,serif;font-style:italic;font-size:20px\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">v</text><text x=\"168\" y=\"284\" style=\"font-family:KaTeX_Math,serif;font-style:italic;font-size:18px\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">u(a)</text><text x=\"408\" y=\"284\" style=\"font-family:KaTeX_Math,serif;font-style:italic;font-size:18px\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">u(b)</text><text x=\"6\" y=\"202\" style=\"font-family:KaTeX_Math,serif;font-style:italic;font-size:18px\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">v(a)</text><text x=\"6\" y=\"58\" style=\"font-family:KaTeX_Math,serif;font-style:italic;font-size:18px\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">v(b)</text><text x=\"315\" y=\"225\" style=\"font-family:KaTeX_Main,serif;font-size:22px\" fill=\"var(--blue)\">∫ v du</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"125\" style=\"font-family:KaTeX_Main,serif;font-size:22px\" fill=\"var(--red)\">∫ u dv</text><text x=\"440\" y=\"120\" style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:17px\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">大長方形 u(b)v(b)</text><text x=\"440\" y=\"200\" style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:17px\" fill=\"var(--muted)\">灰色 u(a)v(a)</text></svg>"}],"t":[302450,318160]},{"show":["藍 ＋ 紅 ＝ 大長方形 － 灰色","$\\int_a^b u\\,dv+\\int_a^b v\\,du=\\Big[uv\\Big]_a^b$"],"say":"藍色加紅色，剛好是大長方形減掉左下角的灰色長方形，也就是 u v 在 b 減在 a。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"藍 ＋ 紅 ＝ 大長方形 － 灰色"},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx6:\\displaystyle \\int_a^b u\\,dv+\\int_a^b v\\,du=\\Big[uv\\Big]_a^b}}$","on":"掉左"},{"do":"box","term":"bx6","on":"減在"}],"t":[318160,326960]},{"show":["紅的難算，就改算藍的"],"say":"這就是分部積分的交換：紅色那塊難算，就去算藍色那塊，再用長方形扣回來。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"紅的難算，就改算藍的","color":"red"},{"do":"write","line":"　圖上 $u$、$v$ 都遞增；一般情形面積帶正負號，公式一樣成立","color":"violet","on":"就去"}],"t":[326960,335560]}],"check":1},{"title":"$v$ 為什麼不用加 $C$","beats":[{"show":["如果用 $v+C$ 代替 $v$：","$u(v+C)-\\int(v+C)\\,du$"],"say":"最後一個問題：從 d v 積出 v 的時候，為什麼不用加 C？我們真的加加看。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"如果用 $v+C$ 代替 $v$："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle u(v+C)-\\int(v+C)\\,du$","on":"時候"}],"t":[346110,354420]},{"show":["$=uv+Cu-\\int v\\,du-Cu$"],"say":"展開：多出一個 C 乘 u；後面的積分也多出 C 乘 u 的積分，就是 C u，但前面是減號。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle =uv+Cu-\\int v\\,du-Cu$"},{"do":"write","line":"　$\\int C\\,du=Cu$（常數放到最後一起寫）","color":"violet","on":"的積#2"}],"t":[354420,364220]},{"show":["$=uv-\\int v\\,du$"],"say":"兩個 C u 一加一減，剛好抵消。所以 v 的常數加了也是白加，挑最簡單的那個就好。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx7:\\displaystyle =uv-\\int v\\,du}}$"},{"do":"box","term":"bx7","on":"的常"}],"t":[364220,373920]},{"show":["常數只在最後寫一次"],"say":"整個分部積分做完、最後一個積分積出來，才寫一次加 C。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"常數只在最後寫一次","color":"red"}],"t":[373920,380350]}],"proof":true,"order":{"ask":"用分部積分的步驟","steps":[{"label":"把被積函數拆成 $u$ 和 $dv$（$u$ 微分變簡單）"},{"label":"算 $du$（微分）和 $v$（積分，不加 $C$）","why":"先要有上一步：把被積函數拆成 $u$ 和 $dv$（$u$ 微分變簡單）"},{"label":"代 $uv-\\int v\\,du$","why":"先要有上一步：算 $du$（微分）和 $v$（積分，不加 $C$）"},{"label":"積出新的積分，最後加 $C$","why":"先要有上一步：代 $uv-\\int v\\,du$"}]}},{"title":"重點整理","beats":[{"show":["• 乘法法則倒過來：$\\int u\\,dv=uv-\\int v\\,du$","• 交換：$u$ 被微分、$v$ 被積分"],"say":"整理一下：分部積分把 u d v 換成 v d u。u 選微分後變簡單的，d v 選積得出來的。定積分時，u v 直接代上下限；v 不加常數。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"• 乘法法則倒過來：$\\int u\\,dv=uv-\\int v\\,du$"},{"do":"write","line":"• 交換：$u$ 被微分、$v$ 被積分","on":"換成"},{"do":"write","line":"• $u$ 選微分後變簡單的（多項式），$dv$ 選積得出來的","on":"選微"},{"do":"write","line":"• 挑錯不會算錯，但新積分會變難：換一種拆法","on":"選積"},{"do":"write","line":"• 定積分：$[uv]_a^b-\\int_a^b v\\,du$，邊界項直接代","on":"定積"},{"do":"write","line":"• $v$ 不加 $C$，最後再加一次","on":"代上"}],"t":[400070,414670]},{"show":["下一課：多項式 × 指數"],"say":"下一課，多項式乘指數：要分部好幾次的時候，怎麼一次寫完。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"下一課：多項式 × 指數"}],"t":[414670,423236]}]}],"checks":[{"ask":"$\\displaystyle\\int x\\cos x\\,dx=$？","options":[{"label":"$x\\sin x+\\cos x+C$","correct":true},{"label":"$x\\sin x-\\cos x+C$","why":"漏了一個負號：$-\\int\\sin x\\,dx=-(-\\cos x)=+\\cos x$"},{"label":"$\\tfrac12x^2\\sin x+C$","why":"把 $x$ 拿去積分、$\\cos x$ 當常數，分部積分不是這樣用"},{"label":"$-x\\sin x+\\cos x+C$","why":"$\\cos x$ 積分是 $+\\sin x$；把它當成微分了"}]},{"ask":"$\\displaystyle\\int_0^1 x e^{x}\\,dx=$？","options":[{"label":"$1$","correct":true},{"label":"$e$","why":"只算了邊界項，忘了減 $\\int_0^1 e^x dx$"},{"label":"$2e-1$","why":"把減號當成加號：$e+(e-1)$"},{"label":"$e-1$","why":"那是 $\\int_0^1 e^x dx$，只是後半段"}]}],"practice":[{"id":"lec-07-m1","core":true},{"id":"int-038","core":true},{"id":"int-017","core":true},{"id":"exam-int-029","core":true},{"id":"cg-4d-001","core":true},{"id":"cg-4d-002","core":true},{"id":"depth-int-016"},{"id":"gap-tech-004"},{"id":"cg-4d-003"},{"id":"int-040","challenge":true,"note":"挑戰：上限是 $\\infty$，$[-x e^{-x}]$ 在 $x\\to\\infty$ 的極限要自己算。"}]},"ibp-poly-exp":{"id":"ibp-poly-exp","prerequisites":["integration-by-parts"],"next":["ibp-poly-trig"],"related":["gamma-definition"],"objectives":["知道 $x^n e^{ax}$ 要分部 $n$ 次：每次讓多項式降一次","會用表格法一次寫完多次分部，正負號交錯","記得 $e^{ax}$ 每積一次要除以 $a$"],"concept":[{"heading":"① 每做一次，降一次","body":["$u=x^2$、$dv=e^xdx$：$du=2x\\,dx$，$v=e^x$","新積分的次方：$2\\to1$，降了一次","再分部：$u=2x$、$dv=e^xdx$","代回去（注意前面的減號）：","微分檢查：$(2x-2)e^x+(x^2-2x+2)e^x=x^2e^x$"],"tex":["\\int x^2e^x\\,dx","\\int x^2e^x\\,dx=x^2e^x-\\int 2x\\,e^x\\,dx","\\int 2xe^x\\,dx=2xe^x-\\int 2e^x\\,dx=2xe^x-2e^x","\\int x^2e^x\\,dx=x^2e^x-\\big(2xe^x-2e^x\\big)","=(x^2-2x+2)e^x+C"]},{"heading":"① 要做幾次？","body":["$x^n e^{ax}$：每分部一次，次方降一","$n$ 次方，就要分部 $n$ 次","次數一多，代回去的括號和正負號最容易錯","三次方的結果：","下一節的表格法，一次寫出這種答案","有沒有辦法一次寫完？"],"tex":["\\int x^3e^x\\,dx=(x^3-3x^2+6x-6)e^x+C"]},{"heading":"② 表格法：一次寫完","body":["左欄 $D$：$u$ 一直微分到 $0$；右欄 $I$：$dv$ 一直積分","斜著乘：左欄第 $k$ 列 $\\times$ 右欄第 $k+1$ 列","為什麼對？每一斜就是一次分部的 $uv$","左欄到 $0$ 就停：剩下的積分是 $\\int 0\\,dx$","表格法適合「$u$ 微分幾次會變 $0$」的情況：多項式"],"tex":["\\def\\arraystretch{1.5}\\begin{array}{c|c|c}\\text{號} & D & I\\\\\\hline + & x^2 & e^x\\\\ - & 2x & e^x\\\\ + & 2 & e^x\\\\ & 0 & e^x\\end{array}","\\int x^2e^x\\,dx=+x^2e^x-2x\\,e^x+2e^x+C"]},{"heading":"③ $e^{ax}$ 的係數","body":["$\\int x^2e^{2x}dx$：右欄每積一次除以 $2$","斜乘：","一般：右欄是 $\\tfrac1ae^{ax},\\ \\tfrac1{a^2}e^{ax},\\ \\tfrac1{a^3}e^{ax},\\dots$","$a$ 是負的也一樣：$\\int e^{-x}dx=-e^{-x}$，除以 $-1$"],"tex":["\\def\\arraystretch{1.5}\\begin{array}{c|c|c}\\text{號} & D & I\\\\\\hline + & x^2 & e^{2x}\\\\ - & 2x & \\tfrac12e^{2x}\\\\ + & 2 & \\tfrac14e^{2x}\\\\ & 0 & \\tfrac18e^{2x}\\end{array}","\\tfrac12x^2e^{2x}-\\tfrac12xe^{2x}+\\tfrac14e^{2x}","\\int x^2e^{2x}dx=e^{2x}\\Big(\\tfrac12x^2-\\tfrac12x+\\tfrac14\\Big)+C"]},{"heading":"③ 一次方：$\\int xe^{ax}dx$","body":["例：$a=3$","微分檢查：$3e^{3x}\\big(\\frac x3-\\frac19\\big)+\\frac13e^{3x}=xe^{3x}$","常見錯：第二項只除一次 $a$，寫成 $\\frac1a$"],"tex":["\\def\\arraystretch{1.5}\\begin{array}{c|c|c}\\text{號} & D & I\\\\\\hline + & x & e^{ax}\\\\ - & 1 & \\tfrac1ae^{ax}\\\\ & 0 & \\tfrac1{a^2}e^{ax}\\end{array}","\\int xe^{ax}\\,dx=e^{ax}\\Big(\\frac xa-\\frac1{a^2}\\Big)+C","\\int xe^{3x}\\,dx=e^{3x}\\Big(\\frac x3-\\frac19\\Big)+C"]},{"heading":"④ 可以直接寫的公式（$a=1$）","body":["$a=1$ 時右欄全是 $e^x$，表格只剩左欄的交錯和：","檢查：$p=x^2$：$x^2-2x+2$","證明：把右邊微分，$(p-p'+p''-\\cdots)'+(p-p'+\\cdots)$ 錯位相消，只剩 $p$","例：$\\displaystyle\\int_0^1(x+1)e^x\\,dx$","$p=x+1$，$p'=1$：反導函數 $(x+1-1)e^x=xe^x$","也可以用 $\\int_a^b u\\,dv=[uv]_a^b-\\int_a^b v\\,du$：$[(x+1)e^x]_0^1-\\int_0^1e^xdx=(2e-1)-(e-1)=e$"],"tex":["\\int p(x)e^x\\,dx=\\big(p-p'+p''-\\cdots\\big)e^x+C","\\int_0^1(x+1)e^x\\,dx=\\Big[xe^x\\Big]_0^1=e-0=e"]},{"heading":"重點整理","body":["• $x^ne^{ax}$：$u$ 選多項式，分部 $n$ 次","• 每次分部，多項式降一次","• 表格法：左欄微分到 $0$，右欄一直積，斜乘、正負交錯","• $e^{ax}$ 每積一次除以 $a$（$a<0$ 也是）","• $a=1$：$\\int pe^x\\,dx=(p-p'+p''-\\cdots)e^x+C$","下一課：多項式 × 三角"]}],"workedExamples":[{"title":"做兩次","prompt":"$\\int x^2 e^x\\,dx$","problemId":"int-052","steps":["第一次：$u=x^2$，$dv=e^x\\,dx$。得 $x^2 e^x-\\int 2x e^x\\,dx$。","第二次處理 $\\int 2x e^x\\,dx$：$u=2x$，$dv=e^x\\,dx$。得 $2x e^x-\\int 2e^x\\,dx=2x e^x-2e^x$。","合起來：$x^2 e^x-(2x e^x-2e^x)=e^x(x^2-2x+2)+C$。注意括號前的減號要分配進去。"],"answer":"$e^x(x^2-2x+2)+C$"},{"title":"表格法","prompt":"$\\int x^2 e^{2x}\\,dx$","steps":["左欄（微分）：$x^2$、$2x$、$2$、$0$。右欄（積分）：$e^{2x}$、$\\frac{e^{2x}}{2}$、$\\frac{e^{2x}}{4}$、$\\frac{e^{2x}}{8}$。","斜乘、正負交錯：$+x^2\\cdot \\frac{e^{2x}}{2}-2x\\cdot \\frac{e^{2x}}{4}+2\\cdot \\frac{e^{2x}}{8}$。","整理：$e^{2x}\\left(\\frac{x^2}{2}-\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{1}{4}\\right)+C$。"],"answer":"$e^{2x}\\left(\\frac{x^2}{2}-\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{1}{4}\\right)+C$"},{"title":"定積分","prompt":"$\\int_0^1 (x+1) e^x\\,dx$","steps":["$u=x+1$，$dv=e^x\\,dx$：$(x+1)e^x-\\int e^x\\,dx=(x+1)e^x-e^x=x e^x$。","代上下限：$[x e^x]_0^1=e-0=e$。","回頭看：$(x e^x)'=e^x+x e^x=(x+1)e^x$，被積函數本來就是一個乘積的導數。"],"answer":"$e$"}],"pitfalls":["第二次分部時，前面的減號沒有分配到每一項。","$e^{2x}$ 積分寫成 $2e^{2x}$；$e^{-x}$ 積分漏了負號。","表格法正負號全部寫成正的。","多項式微分沒有做到 $0$ 就停，少了最後一項常數。"],"voice":"1ec6d2d2","sections":[{"title":"每做一次，降一次","beats":[{"show":["$\\int x^2e^x\\,dx$"],"say":"上一課做過 x 乘 e 的 x 次方，分部一次就好。這一課把 x 換成 x 平方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int x^2e^x\\,dx$"}],"t":[2980,13430]},{"show":["$u=x^2$、$dv=e^xdx$：$du=2x\\,dx$，$v=e^x$","$\\int x^2e^x\\,dx=x^2e^x-\\int 2x\\,e^x\\,dx$"],"say":"一樣讓多項式當 u。x 平方微分是 2x，e 的 x 次方積分還是自己。代公式，新的積分是 2x 乘 e 的 x 次方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$u=x^2$、$dv=e^xdx$：$du=2x\\,dx$，$v=e^x$"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int x^2e^x\\,dx=x^2e^x-\\int 2x\\,e^x\\,dx$","on":"分還"}],"t":[13430,25830]},{"show":["新積分的次方：$2\\to1$，降了一次"],"say":"注意：x 平方變成 x，次方降了一次。但還沒積完，要再分部一次。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"新積分的次方：$2\\to1$，降了一次","color":"red"}],"t":[25830,36420]},{"show":["再分部：$u=2x$、$dv=e^xdx$","$\\int 2xe^x\\,dx=2xe^x-\\int 2e^x\\,dx=2xe^x-2e^x$"],"say":"第二次，讓 2x 當 u。微分變 2，新的積分只剩 2 倍 e 的 x 次方，直接積。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"再分部：$u=2x$、$dv=e^xdx$"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int 2xe^x\\,dx=2xe^x-\\int 2e^x\\,dx=2xe^x-2e^x$","on":"積分"}],"t":[36420,46930]},{"show":["代回去（注意前面的減號）：","$\\int x^2e^x\\,dx=x^2e^x-\\big(2xe^x-2e^x\\big)$"],"say":"代回去。前面有一個減號，括號要整個減掉。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"代回去（注意前面的減號）："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int x^2e^x\\,dx=x^2e^x-\\big(2xe^x-2e^x\\big)$","on":"括號"}],"t":[46930,53020]},{"show":["$=(x^2-2x+2)e^x+C$"],"say":"整理成 x 平方減 2x 加 2，乘上 e 的 x 次方，加 C。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx1:\\displaystyle =(x^2-2x+2)e^x+C}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx1","color":"red","on":"乘上"},{"do":"write","line":"　微分檢查：$(2x-2)e^x+(x^2-2x+2)e^x=x^2e^x$","color":"violet","on":"次方"}],"t":[53020,60720]}]},{"title":"要做幾次？","beats":[{"show":["$x^n e^{ax}$：每分部一次，次方降一"],"say":"規律很清楚：每分部一次，多項式的次方降一。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$x^n e^{ax}$：每分部一次，次方降一"}],"t":[60720,66300]},{"show":["$n$ 次方，就要分部 $n$ 次"],"say":"所以 x 的 n 次方乘指數，就要分部 n 次，直到多項式微分成常數，最後一個積分只剩指數。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$n$ 次方，就要分部 $n$ 次","color":"gold"}],"t":[66300,75900]}],"predict":{"ask":"$\\displaystyle\\int x^3e^x\\,dx$ 要分部幾次？","options":[{"label":"$3$ 次","correct":true},{"label":"$1$ 次","why":"一次之後還剩 $\\int 3x^2e^x\\,dx$，還要繼續"},{"label":"$4$ 次","why":"第三次分部後新積分已經是常數乘 $e^x$，直接積，不用再分"}]}},{"title":"要做幾次？","beats":[{"show":["次數一多，代回去的括號和正負號最容易錯"],"say":"次數一多，一層一層代回去，括號跟正負號就很容易錯。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"次數一多，代回去的括號和正負號最容易錯","color":"red"}],"t":[84410,92080]},{"show":["三次方的結果：","$\\int x^3e^x\\,dx=(x^3-3x^2+6x-6)e^x+C$"],"say":"例如三次方的答案，是 x 三次方減 3x 平方加 6x 減 6，再乘 e 的 x 次方。正負號交錯出現。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"三次方的結果："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int x^3e^x\\,dx=(x^3-3x^2+6x-6)e^x+C$","on":"3x"},{"do":"write","line":"　下一節的表格法，一次寫出這種答案","color":"violet","on":"次方#3"}],"t":[92080,102880]},{"show":["有沒有辦法一次寫完？"],"say":"有沒有辦法不要一層一層代，一次寫完？有，就是表格法。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"有沒有辦法一次寫完？"}],"t":[102880,110720]}]},{"title":"表格法：一次寫完","beats":[{"show":["左欄 $D$：$u$ 一直微分到 $0$；右欄 $I$：$dv$ 一直積分"],"say":"表格法：左欄放 u，一直微分到 0；右欄放 d v 裡的函數，一直積分。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"左欄 $D$：$u$ 一直微分到 $0$；右欄 $I$：$dv$ 一直積分"}],"t":[110720,118320]},{"show":["$\\def\\arraystretch{1.5}\\begin{array}{c|c|c}\\text{號} & D & I\\\\\\hline + & x^2 & e^x\\\\ - & 2x & e^x\\\\ + & 2 & e^x\\\\ & 0 & e^x\\end{array}$"],"say":"用 x 平方乘 e 的 x 次方來看。左欄：x 平方、2x、2、0。右欄每一格都是 e 的 x 次方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\def\\arraystretch{1.5}{\\begin{array}{c|c|c}\\text{號} & D & I\\\\\\hline + & x^2 & e^x\\\\ - & 2x & e^x\\\\ + & 2 & e^x\\\\ & 0 & e^x\\end{array}}$"}],"t":[118320,129470]},{"show":["斜著乘：左欄第 $k$ 列 $\\times$ 右欄第 $k+1$ 列"],"say":"然後斜著乘：左欄每一列，乘上右欄的下一列。正負號從正開始，正負交錯。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"斜著乘：左欄第 $k$ 列 $\\times$ 右欄第 $k+1$ 列"}],"t":[129470,139420]},{"show":["$\\int x^2e^x\\,dx=+x^2e^x-2x\\,e^x+2e^x+C$"],"say":"正的 x 平方 e 的 x 次方，負的 2x e 的 x 次方，正的 2 e 的 x 次方。跟剛剛一層一層代的結果一模一樣。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx2:\\displaystyle \\int x^2e^x\\,dx=+x^2e^x-2x\\,e^x+2e^x+C}}$"},{"do":"box","term":"bx2","on":"正的#2"}],"t":[139420,152220]},{"show":["為什麼對？每一斜就是一次分部的 $uv$"],"say":"為什麼對？每一條斜線，就是一次分部的 u 乘 v；正負交錯，是因為每多分部一次，前面就多一個減號。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"為什麼對？每一斜就是一次分部的 $uv$"}],"t":[152220,163310]},{"show":["左欄到 $0$ 就停：剩下的積分是 $\\int 0\\,dx$"],"say":"左欄微分到 0 就停，因為剩下的積分是 0，不用再積。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"左欄到 $0$ 就停：剩下的積分是 $\\int 0\\,dx$"},{"do":"write","line":"　表格法適合「$u$ 微分幾次會變 $0$」的情況：多項式","color":"violet","on":"剩下"}],"t":[163310,172070]}]},{"title":"$e^{ax}$ 的係數","beats":[{"show":["$\\int x^2e^{2x}dx$：右欄每積一次除以 $2$","$\\def\\arraystretch{1.5}\\begin{array}{c|c|c}\\text{號} & D & I\\\\\\hline + & x^2 & e^{2x}\\\\ - & 2x & \\tfrac12e^{2x}\\\\ + & 2 & \\tfrac14e^{2x}\\\\ & 0 & \\tfrac18e^{2x}\\end{array}$"],"say":"換成 e 的 2x 次方。右欄每往下積一次，就要除以 2：2 分之 1、4 分之 1、8 分之 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\int x^2e^{2x}dx$：右欄每積一次除以 $2$"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\def\\arraystretch{1.5}{\\begin{array}{c|c|c}\\text{號} & D & I\\\\\\hline + & x^2 & e^{2x}\\\\ - & 2x & \\tfrac12e^{2x}\\\\ + & 2 & \\tfrac14e^{2x}\\\\ & 0 & \\tfrac18e^{2x}\\end{array}}$","on":"分之#1"}],"t":[172070,183620]},{"show":["斜乘：","$\\tfrac12x^2e^{2x}-\\tfrac12xe^{2x}+\\tfrac14e^{2x}$"],"say":"斜著乘：x 平方乘 2 分之 1，負的 2x 乘 4 分之 1，正的 2 乘 8 分之 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"斜乘："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\tfrac12x^2e^{2x}-\\tfrac12xe^{2x}+\\tfrac14e^{2x}$","on":"分之#2"}],"t":[183620,193920]},{"show":["$\\int x^2e^{2x}dx=e^{2x}\\Big(\\tfrac12x^2-\\tfrac12x+\\tfrac14\\Big)+C$"],"say":"整理成 e 的 2x 次方，乘上 2 分之 1 x 平方，減 2 分之 1 x，加 4 分之 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx3:\\displaystyle \\int x^2e^{2x}dx=e^{2x}\\Big(\\tfrac12x^2-\\tfrac12x+\\tfrac14\\Big)+C}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx3","color":"red","on":"平方"}],"t":[193920,204120]},{"show":["一般：右欄是 $\\tfrac1ae^{ax},\\ \\tfrac1{a^2}e^{ax},\\ \\tfrac1{a^3}e^{ax},\\dots$"],"say":"一般來說，e 的 a x 次方，右欄依序是 a 分之 1、a 平方分之 1、a 三次方分之 1 倍。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"一般：右欄是 $\\tfrac1ae^{ax},\\ \\tfrac1{a^2}e^{ax},\\ \\tfrac1{a^3}e^{ax},\\dots$"},{"do":"write","line":"　$a$ 是負的也一樣：$\\int e^{-x}dx=-e^{-x}$，除以 $-1$","color":"violet","on":"平方"}],"t":[204120,214520]}],"check":0},{"title":"一次方：$\\int xe^{ax}dx$","beats":[{"show":["$\\def\\arraystretch{1.5}\\begin{array}{c|c|c}\\text{號} & D & I\\\\\\hline + & x & e^{ax}\\\\ - & 1 & \\tfrac1ae^{ax}\\\\ & 0 & \\tfrac1{a^2}e^{ax}\\end{array}$"],"say":"最常見的是一次方：x 乘 e 的 a x 次方。表格只有兩斜：x 乘 a 分之 1，負的 1 乘 a 平方分之 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\def\\arraystretch{1.5}{\\begin{array}{c|c|c}\\text{號} & D & I\\\\\\hline + & x & e^{ax}\\\\ - & 1 & \\tfrac1ae^{ax}\\\\ & 0 & \\tfrac1{a^2}e^{ax}\\end{array}}$"}],"t":[224640,236640]},{"show":["$\\int xe^{ax}\\,dx=e^{ax}\\Big(\\frac xa-\\frac1{a^2}\\Big)+C$"],"say":"所以答案是 e 的 a x 次方，乘上 a 分之 x 減 a 平方分之 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx4:\\displaystyle \\int xe^{ax}\\,dx=e^{ax}\\Big(\\frac xa-\\frac1{a^2}\\Big)+C}}$"},{"do":"box","term":"bx4","on":"分之#1"}],"t":[236640,246490]},{"show":["例：$a=3$","$\\int xe^{3x}\\,dx=e^{3x}\\Big(\\frac x3-\\frac19\\Big)+C$"],"say":"例如 a 等於 3：e 的 3x 次方，乘 3 分之 x 減 9 分之 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"例：$a=3$"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int xe^{3x}\\,dx=e^{3x}\\Big(\\frac x3-\\frac19\\Big)+C$","on":"3x"},{"do":"write","line":"　微分檢查：$3e^{3x}\\big(\\frac x3-\\frac19\\big)+\\frac13e^{3x}=xe^{3x}$","color":"violet","on":"分之#2"}],"t":[246490,254490]},{"show":["常見錯：第二項只除一次 $a$，寫成 $\\frac1a$"],"say":"常見的錯：第二項只除了一次 a。記得右欄往下第二格已經積了兩次，是 a 平方分之 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"常見錯：第二項只除一次 $a$，寫成 $\\frac1a$","color":"red"}],"t":[254490,267660]}]},{"title":"可以直接寫的公式（$a=1$）","beats":[{"show":["$a=1$ 時右欄全是 $e^x$，表格只剩左欄的交錯和：","$\\int p(x)e^x\\,dx=\\big(p-p'+p''-\\cdots\\big)e^x+C$"],"say":"a 等於 1 的時候，右欄每一格都是 e 的 x 次方，所以答案就是：p 減 p prime 加 p 兩撇，正負交錯，再乘 e 的 x 次方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$a=1$ 時右欄全是 $e^x$，表格只剩左欄的交錯和："},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx5:\\displaystyle \\int p(x)e^x\\,dx=\\big(p-p'+p''-\\cdots\\big)e^x+C}}$","on":"次方#1"},{"do":"box","term":"bx5","on":"兩撇"}],"t":[267660,282260]},{"show":["檢查：$p=x^2$：$x^2-2x+2$"],"say":"檢查：p 是 x 平方，p prime 是 2x，p 兩撇是 2，正好是 x 平方減 2x 加 2。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"檢查：$p=x^2$：$x^2-2x+2$"},{"do":"write","line":"　證明：把右邊微分，$(p-p'+p''-\\cdots)'+(p-p'+\\cdots)$ 錯位相消，只剩 $p$","color":"violet","on":"兩撇"}],"t":[282260,293360]},{"show":["例：$\\displaystyle\\int_0^1(x+1)e^x\\,dx$"],"say":"用這個公式做一題定積分：x 加 1 乘 e 的 x 次方，從 0 到 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"例：$\\displaystyle\\int_0^1(x+1)e^x\\,dx$"}],"t":[293360,301160]},{"show":["$p=x+1$，$p'=1$：反導函數 $(x+1-1)e^x=xe^x$"],"say":"p 是 x 加 1，p prime 是 1，所以反導函數是 x 加 1 減 1，乘 e 的 x 次方，就是 x 乘 e 的 x 次方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$p=x+1$，$p'=1$：反導函數 $(x+1-1)e^x=xe^x$"}],"t":[301160,314960]},{"show":["$\\int_0^1(x+1)e^x\\,dx=\\Big[xe^x\\Big]_0^1=e-0=e$"],"say":"代上下限：1 乘 e 減掉 0，答案是 e。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx6:\\displaystyle \\int_0^1(x+1)e^x\\,dx=\\Big[xe^x\\Big]_0^1=e-0=e}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx6","color":"red","on":"減掉"},{"do":"write","line":"　也可以用 $\\int_a^b u\\,dv=[uv]_a^b-\\int_a^b v\\,du$：$[(x+1)e^x]_0^1-\\int_0^1e^xdx=(2e-1)-(e-1)=e$","color":"violet","on":"答案"}],"t":[314960,320460]}]},{"title":"試一題","beats":[{"show":["$\\displaystyle\\int (x^2+1)e^x\\,dx=$？"],"say":"用公式試一題。","t":[320460,330970]}],"check":1},{"title":"試一題","beats":[{"show":["表格法的步驟"],"say":"排排看表格法的步驟。","t":[330970,349150]}],"proof":true,"order":{"ask":"表格法的步驟","steps":[{"label":"左欄放多項式 $u$，右欄放 $dv$ 的函數"},{"label":"左欄一直微分到 $0$，右欄一直積分（$e^{ax}$ 每次除以 $a$）","why":"先要有上一步：左欄放多項式 $u$，右欄放 $dv$ 的函數"},{"label":"左欄每列斜乘右欄下一列，正負號 $+,-,+,\\dots$","why":"先要有上一步：左欄一直微分到 $0$，右欄一直積分（$e^{ax}$ 每次除以 $a$）"},{"label":"全部加起來，最後加 $C$","why":"先要有上一步：左欄每列斜乘右欄下一列，正負號 $+,-,+,\\dots$"}]}},{"title":"重點整理","beats":[{"show":["• $x^ne^{ax}$：$u$ 選多項式，分部 $n$ 次","• 每次分部，多項式降一次"],"say":"整理一下：多項式乘指數，多項式當 u，每分部一次降一次。表格法左欄微分、右欄積分，斜乘、正負交錯。e 的 a x 次方每積一次要除以 a。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"• $x^ne^{ax}$：$u$ 選多項式，分部 $n$ 次"},{"do":"write","line":"• 每次分部，多項式降一次","on":"項式#2"},{"do":"write","line":"• 表格法：左欄微分到 $0$，右欄一直積，斜乘、正負交錯","on":"表格"},{"do":"write","line":"• $e^{ax}$ 每積一次除以 $a$（$a<0$ 也是）","on":"斜乘"},{"do":"write","line":"• $a=1$：$\\int pe^x\\,dx=(p-p'+p''-\\cdots)e^x+C$","on":"次方"}],"t":[349150,364620]},{"show":["下一課：多項式 × 三角"],"say":"下一課，多項式乘三角函數：表格法照用，只是右欄會多出一組正負號。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"下一課：多項式 × 三角"}],"t":[364620,374073]}]}],"checks":[{"ask":"$\\displaystyle\\int x^2e^{-x}\\,dx=$？","options":[{"label":"$-(x^2+2x+2)e^{-x}+C$","correct":true},{"label":"$(x^2-2x+2)e^{-x}+C$","why":"這是照 $e^x$ 的答案抄；$e^{-x}$ 每積一次要除以 $-1$"},{"label":"$-(x^2-2x+2)e^{-x}+C$","why":"只處理了第一個負號；右欄的負號每列都在變"},{"label":"$(x^2+2x+2)e^{-x}+C$","why":"少了整體的負號：$\\int e^{-x}dx=-e^{-x}$"}]},{"ask":"$\\displaystyle\\int (x^2+1)e^x\\,dx=$？","options":[{"label":"$(x^2-2x+3)e^x+C$","correct":true},{"label":"$(x^2+2x+3)e^x+C$","why":"$p'$ 前面是減號，不是加號"},{"label":"$(x^2-2x+1)e^x+C$","why":"漏了 $p''=2$"},{"label":"$(x^2-2x+2)e^x+C$","why":"那是 $\\int x^2e^x\\,dx$，忘了 $+1$ 那一項"}]}],"practice":[{"id":"cx-exam-006","core":true},{"id":"burst-int-041","core":true,"note":"$e^{-x}$：右欄每一格符號都會翻。"},{"id":"burst-int-036","core":true},{"id":"burst-boss-anti-001","core":true},{"id":"cg-4d-004","core":true},{"id":"burst-boss-anti-002"},{"id":"cg-4d-005"},{"id":"burst-boss2-anti-001","challenge":true,"note":"挑戰：五次多項式，表格有六列。"},{"id":"hc-usub-002","challenge":true,"note":"挑戰：先換元 $u=x^2$，變成 $\\frac{1}{2}\\int u^2 e^u\\,du$ 再分部。"}]},"ibp-poly-trig":{"id":"ibp-poly-trig","prerequisites":["ibp-poly-exp"],"next":["ibp-log-invtrig"],"related":["trig-identity-integrals"],"objectives":["會用表格法積 $x^n\\sin(ax)$、$x^n\\cos(ax)$","分清楚兩組正負號：表格斜乘的 $+$、$-$ 交錯，以及 $\\sin$、$\\cos$ 反覆積分本身帶出的負號","定積分時會用 $\\sin(n\\pi)=0$、$\\cos(n\\pi)=(-1)^n$ 化簡邊界項"],"concept":[{"heading":"① 跟指數一樣的策略","body":["$u$ 選多項式：微分會降次","$dv$ 選 $\\sin x\\,dx$：一直積得出來","$x^2$：要分部 $2$ 次，用表格法一次寫完","三角函數微分、積分都不會變簡單，所以讓多項式去微分"],"tex":["\\int x^2\\sin x\\,dx"]},{"heading":"② 右欄：$\\sin$ 一直積分","body":["右欄一直積：","檢查：$(-\\cos x)'=\\sin x$，$(-\\sin x)'=-\\cos x$","右欄自己就帶負號，跟斜乘的 $+,-$ 是兩回事","斜乘（兩組號都乘進去）：","微分檢查：$-2x\\cos x+x^2\\sin x+2\\sin x+2x\\cos x-2\\sin x=x^2\\sin x$"],"tex":["\\sin x\\ \\to\\ -\\cos x\\ \\to\\ -\\sin x\\ \\to\\ \\cos x\\ \\to\\ \\sin x","\\def\\arraystretch{1.5}\\begin{array}{c|c|c}\\text{號} & D & I\\\\\\hline + & x^2 & \\sin x\\\\ - & 2x & -\\cos x\\\\ + & 2 & -\\sin x\\\\ & 0 & \\cos x\\end{array}","+x^2(-\\cos x)\\ -\\ 2x(-\\sin x)\\ +\\ 2\\cos x","\\begin{aligned}\\int x^2\\sin x\\,dx=\\ &-x^2\\cos x+2x\\sin x\\\\&+2\\cos x+C\\end{aligned}"]},{"heading":"② 試一題","body":["結果：","兩組負號的口訣：表格管斜乘，右欄管自己"],"tex":["\\begin{aligned}\\int x\\cos x\\,dx&=x\\sin x-1\\cdot(-\\cos x)\\\\&=x\\sin x+\\cos x+C\\end{aligned}"]},{"heading":"③ 裡面是 $ax$","body":["$\\int x^2\\cos 2x\\,dx$：右欄每積一次除以 $2$，也照樣變號","斜乘：","右欄第 $k$ 格的係數是 $\\frac1{a^k}$，跟 $e^{ax}$ 一樣"],"tex":["\\def\\arraystretch{1.5}\\begin{array}{c|c|c}\\text{號} & D & I\\\\\\hline + & x^2 & \\cos 2x\\\\ - & 2x & \\tfrac12\\sin 2x\\\\ + & 2 & -\\tfrac14\\cos 2x\\\\ & 0 & -\\tfrac18\\sin 2x\\end{array}","\\tfrac12x^2\\sin2x-2x\\Big(-\\tfrac14\\cos2x\\Big)+2\\Big(-\\tfrac18\\sin2x\\Big)","\\begin{aligned}\\int x^2\\cos2x\\,dx=\\ &\\tfrac12x^2\\sin2x+\\tfrac12x\\cos2x\\\\&-\\tfrac14\\sin2x+C\\end{aligned}"]},{"heading":"④ 定積分的邊界項","body":["整數 $n$：","$\\displaystyle\\int_0^\\pi x^2\\cos x\\,dx$：表格得","右欄：$\\cos x,\\ \\sin x,\\ -\\cos x,\\ -\\sin x$","$x=\\pi$：所有 $\\sin$ 項都是 $0$，$\\cos\\pi=-1$","$x=0$：$F(0)=0+0-0=0$","先看哪些項會被 $\\sin(n\\pi)=0$ 或 $x=0$ 消掉，邊界項就很好算"],"tex":["\\sin(n\\pi)=0,\\qquad\\cos(n\\pi)=(-1)^n","F(x)=x^2\\sin x+2x\\cos x-2\\sin x","F(\\pi)=0+2\\pi(-1)-0=-2\\pi","\\int_0^\\pi x^2\\cos x\\,dx=-2\\pi-0=-2\\pi"]},{"heading":"④ 試一題","body":["一般：","反導函數 $-\\frac xn\\cos nx+\\frac1{n^2}\\sin nx$，在 $\\pi$ 代入 $\\cos n\\pi=(-1)^n$"],"tex":["\\int_0^\\pi x\\sin nx\\,dx=\\frac{(-1)^{n+1}\\pi}{n}"]},{"heading":"⑤ 不是單一個 $\\sin$、$\\cos$ 時","body":["$\\int x\\sin^2x\\,dx$：$\\sin^2x$ 不好積，先降次","同樣：$x\\sin x\\cos x=\\tfrac12x\\sin2x$（倍角）","原則：先把三角部分化成單一個 $\\sin(ax)$、$\\cos(ax)$，再分部"],"tex":["\\sin^2x=\\frac{1-\\cos2x}2","\\int x\\sin^2x\\,dx=\\frac{x^2}4-\\frac12\\int x\\cos2x\\,dx","=\\frac{x^2}4-\\frac x4\\sin2x-\\frac18\\cos2x+C"]},{"heading":"⑤ $dv$ 選積得出來的","body":["$\\int x\\sec^2x\\,dx$：$\\sec^2x$ 積得出來（$=\\tan x$）","$\\int\\tan x\\,dx=-\\ln|\\cos x|+C$（換元 $w=\\cos x$）"],"tex":["\\int x\\sec^2x\\,dx=x\\tan x-\\int\\tan x\\,dx","=x\\tan x+\\ln|\\cos x|+C"]},{"heading":"重點整理","body":["• $x^n\\sin ax$、$x^n\\cos ax$：多項式當 $u$，表格法","• 右欄循環：$\\sin\\to-\\cos\\to-\\sin\\to\\cos$，每次除以 $a$","• 兩組正負號：斜乘的 $+,-$，乘上右欄自己的號","• 定積分：$\\sin n\\pi=0$，$\\cos n\\pi=(-1)^n$","• $\\sin^2$、$\\sin\\cos$：先降次；$\\sec^2$ 這類積得出來的也能當 $dv$","下一課：$\\ln x$、反三角函數"]}],"workedExamples":[{"title":"表格法","prompt":"$\\int x^2\\sin x\\,dx$","problemId":"int-053","steps":["左欄：$x^2$、$2x$、$2$、$0$。右欄：$\\sin x$、$-\\cos x$、$-\\sin x$、$\\cos x$。","斜乘、$+\\,-\\,+$ 交錯：$+x^2\\cdot(-\\cos x)-2x\\cdot(-\\sin x)+2\\cdot\\cos x$。","整理：$-x^2\\cos x+2x\\sin x+2\\cos x+C$。"],"answer":"$-x^2\\cos x+2x\\sin x+2\\cos x+C$"},{"title":"裡面是 $2x$","prompt":"$\\int x^2\\cos 2x\\,dx$","steps":["左欄：$x^2$、$2x$、$2$、$0$。右欄：$\\cos 2x$、$\\frac{\\sin 2x}{2}$、$-\\frac{\\cos 2x}{4}$、$-\\frac{\\sin 2x}{8}$。","斜乘：$+x^2\\cdot\\frac{\\sin 2x}{2}-2x\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{\\cos 2x}{4}\\right)+2\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{\\sin 2x}{8}\\right)$。","整理：$\\frac{x^2}{2}\\sin 2x+\\frac{x}{2}\\cos 2x-\\frac{1}{4}\\sin 2x+C$。"],"answer":"$\\frac{x^2}{2}\\sin 2x+\\frac{x}{2}\\cos 2x-\\frac{1}{4}\\sin 2x+C$"},{"title":"定積分","prompt":"$\\int_0^\\pi x^2\\cos x\\,dx$","steps":["表格得反導函數 $x^2\\sin x+2x\\cos x-2\\sin x$。","代 $\\pi$：$\\sin\\pi=0$，$\\cos\\pi=-1$，得 $0+2\\pi\\cdot(-1)-0=-2\\pi$。","代 $0$：$0+0-0=0$。","答案：$-2\\pi$。"],"answer":"$-2\\pi$"}],"pitfalls":["右欄寫成微分的順序（$\\sin\\to\\cos$），而不是積分（$\\sin\\to -\\cos$）。","只算了表格的正負交錯，忘了右欄本身的負號，或反過來。","$\\sin 2x$ 積分寫成 $-2\\cos 2x$：要除以 $2$，不是乘 $2$。","代 $\\pi$ 時把 $\\cos\\pi$ 當成 $1$。"],"voice":"b6c1d655","sections":[{"title":"跟指數一樣的策略","beats":[{"show":["$\\int x^2\\sin x\\,dx$"],"say":"這一課看多項式乘三角函數，例如 x 平方乘正弦 x。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int x^2\\sin x\\,dx$"}],"t":[2980,10320]},{"show":["$u$ 選多項式：微分會降次","$dv$ 選 $\\sin x\\,dx$：一直積得出來"],"say":"策略跟指數完全一樣：多項式當 u，每微分一次降一次；正弦當 d v，因為正弦餘弦怎麼積都積得出來。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$u$ 選多項式：微分會降次"},{"do":"write","line":"$dv$ 選 $\\sin x\\,dx$：一直積得出來","on":"正弦#1"}],"t":[10320,20610]},{"show":["$x^2$：要分部 $2$ 次，用表格法一次寫完"],"say":"x 平方要分部兩次。直接用上一課的表格法。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$x^2$：要分部 $2$ 次，用表格法一次寫完","color":"gold"}],"t":[20610,27330]}],"predict":{"ask":"如果反過來讓 $u=\\sin x$、$dv=x^2dx$，會怎樣？","options":[{"label":"新積分變成 $\\int\\frac{x^3}3\\cos x\\,dx$，更難","correct":true},{"label":"一樣做得出來，只是步驟多一點","why":"每分部一次次方就升一次，永遠積不完"},{"label":"新積分變成 $\\int 2x\\cos x\\,dx$","why":"那是 $x^2$ 被微分的情況；這裡 $x^2$ 是被積分"}]}},{"title":"跟指數一樣的策略","beats":[{"show":["三角函數微分、積分都不會變簡單，所以讓多項式去微分"],"say":"三角函數不管微分還是積分，都還是三角函數，不會變簡單；會變簡單的只有多項式。所以多項式一定當 u。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"三角函數微分、積分都不會變簡單，所以讓多項式去微分"}],"t":[37170,51350]}]},{"title":"右欄：$\\sin$ 一直積分","beats":[{"show":["右欄一直積：","$\\sin x\\ \\to\\ -\\cos x\\ \\to\\ -\\sin x\\ \\to\\ \\cos x\\ \\to\\ \\sin x$"],"say":"先看右欄。正弦積分是負餘弦；負餘弦積分是負正弦；負正弦積分是餘弦；餘弦積分又回到正弦。四次一個循環。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"右欄一直積："},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx1:\\displaystyle \\sin x\\ \\to\\ -\\cos x\\ \\to\\ -\\sin x\\ \\to\\ \\cos x\\ \\to\\ \\sin x}}$","on":"負餘#2"},{"do":"box","term":"bx1","on":"正弦#3"},{"do":"write","line":"　檢查：$(-\\cos x)'=\\sin x$，$(-\\sin x)'=-\\cos x$","color":"violet","on":"又回"}],"t":[51350,64590]},{"show":["右欄自己就帶負號，跟斜乘的 $+,-$ 是兩回事"],"say":"注意，右欄自己就會帶出負號。這跟表格斜乘的正負交錯，是兩組不同的正負號，兩組都要算。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"右欄自己就帶負號，跟斜乘的 $+,-$ 是兩回事","color":"red"}],"t":[64590,75050]},{"show":["$\\def\\arraystretch{1.5}\\begin{array}{c|c|c}\\text{號} & D & I\\\\\\hline + & x^2 & \\sin x\\\\ - & 2x & -\\cos x\\\\ + & 2 & -\\sin x\\\\ & 0 & \\cos x\\end{array}$"],"say":"填表：左欄 x 平方、2x、2、0；右欄正弦、負餘弦、負正弦、餘弦。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\def\\arraystretch{1.5}{\\begin{array}{c|c|c}\\text{號} & D & I\\\\\\hline + & x^2 & \\sin x\\\\ - & 2x & -\\cos x\\\\ + & 2 & -\\sin x\\\\ & 0 & \\cos x\\end{array}}$"}],"t":[75050,86280]},{"show":["斜乘（兩組號都乘進去）：","$+x^2(-\\cos x)\\ -\\ 2x(-\\sin x)\\ +\\ 2\\cos x$"],"say":"斜著乘：正號乘 x 平方乘負餘弦；負號乘 2x 乘負正弦；正號乘 2 乘餘弦。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"斜乘（兩組號都乘進去）："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle +x^2(-\\cos x)\\ -\\ 2x(-\\sin x)\\ +\\ 2\\cos x$","on":"2x"}],"t":[86280,94860]},{"show":["$\\begin{aligned}\\int x^2\\sin x\\,dx=\\ &-x^2\\cos x+2x\\sin x\\\\&+2\\cos x+C\\end{aligned}$"],"say":"整理：負 x 平方餘弦 x，加 2x 正弦 x，加 2 餘弦 x，加 C。中間那一項是負負得正。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx2:\\displaystyle {\\begin{aligned}\\int x^2\\sin x\\,dx=\\ &-x^2\\cos x+2x\\sin x\\\\&+2\\cos x+C\\end{aligned}}}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx2","color":"red","on":"2x"},{"do":"write","line":"　微分檢查：$-2x\\cos x+x^2\\sin x+2\\sin x+2x\\cos x-2\\sin x=x^2\\sin x$","color":"violet","on":"中間"}],"t":[94860,105580]}]},{"title":"試一題","beats":[{"show":["$\\displaystyle\\int x\\cos x\\,dx$ 用表格法，右欄依序是？"],"say":"先確認右欄：x 乘餘弦 x，右欄怎麼寫？","t":[105580,117310]}],"check":0},{"title":"試一題","beats":[{"show":["結果：","$\\begin{aligned}\\int x\\cos x\\,dx&=x\\sin x-1\\cdot(-\\cos x)\\\\&=x\\sin x+\\cos x+C\\end{aligned}$"],"say":"斜乘：正的 x 乘正弦，負的 1 乘負餘弦，所以是 x 正弦 x 加餘弦 x。跟上一課算的一樣。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"結果："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle {\\begin{aligned}\\int x\\cos x\\,dx&=x\\sin x-1\\cdot(-\\cos x)\\\\&=x\\sin x+\\cos x+C\\end{aligned}}$","on":"正弦#2"}],"t":[117310,127340]},{"show":["兩組負號的口訣：表格管斜乘，右欄管自己"],"say":"記法：表格的正負，管的是斜乘那一步；右欄的負號，是積分本身算出來的。分開處理，最後再相乘。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"兩組負號的口訣：表格管斜乘，右欄管自己","color":"gold"}],"t":[127340,142000]}]},{"title":"裡面是 $ax$","beats":[{"show":["$\\int x^2\\cos 2x\\,dx$：右欄每積一次除以 $2$，也照樣變號","$\\def\\arraystretch{1.5}\\begin{array}{c|c|c}\\text{號} & D & I\\\\\\hline + & x^2 & \\cos 2x\\\\ - & 2x & \\tfrac12\\sin 2x\\\\ + & 2 & -\\tfrac14\\cos 2x\\\\ & 0 & -\\tfrac18\\sin 2x\\end{array}$"],"say":"裡面是 2x 的時候，右欄每積一次除以 2，而且正負號照樣循環：2 分之 1 正弦，負 4 分之 1 餘弦，負 8 分之 1 正弦。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\int x^2\\cos 2x\\,dx$：右欄每積一次除以 $2$，也照樣變號"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\def\\arraystretch{1.5}{\\begin{array}{c|c|c}\\text{號} & D & I\\\\\\hline + & x^2 & \\cos 2x\\\\ - & 2x & \\tfrac12\\sin 2x\\\\ + & 2 & -\\tfrac14\\cos 2x\\\\ & 0 & -\\tfrac18\\sin 2x\\end{array}}$","on":"分之#1"}],"t":[142000,157450]},{"show":["斜乘：","$\\tfrac12x^2\\sin2x-2x\\Big(-\\tfrac14\\cos2x\\Big)+2\\Big(-\\tfrac18\\sin2x\\Big)$"],"say":"斜乘：x 平方乘 2 分之 1 正弦；負的 2x 乘負 4 分之 1 餘弦；2 乘負 8 分之 1 正弦。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"斜乘："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\tfrac12x^2\\sin2x-2x\\Big(-\\tfrac14\\cos2x\\Big)+2\\Big(-\\tfrac18\\sin2x\\Big)$","on":"分之#2"}],"t":[157450,168450]},{"show":["$\\begin{aligned}\\int x^2\\cos2x\\,dx=\\ &\\tfrac12x^2\\sin2x+\\tfrac12x\\cos2x\\\\&-\\tfrac14\\sin2x+C\\end{aligned}$"],"say":"整理：2 分之 1 x 平方正弦 2x，加 2 分之 1 x 餘弦 2x，減 4 分之 1 正弦 2x。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx3:\\displaystyle {\\begin{aligned}\\int x^2\\cos2x\\,dx=\\ &\\tfrac12x^2\\sin2x+\\tfrac12x\\cos2x\\\\&-\\tfrac14\\sin2x+C\\end{aligned}}}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx3","color":"red","on":"2x#1"},{"do":"write","line":"　右欄第 $k$ 格的係數是 $\\frac1{a^k}$，跟 $e^{ax}$ 一樣","color":"violet","on":"2x#2"}],"t":[168450,179250]}],"check":1},{"title":"定積分的邊界項","beats":[{"show":["整數 $n$：","$\\sin(n\\pi)=0,\\qquad\\cos(n\\pi)=(-1)^n$"],"say":"定積分的上下限常常是派的整數倍。這時候兩個事實很好用：正弦 n 派一定是 0；餘弦 n 派，n 是偶數得 1，奇數得負 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"整數 $n$："},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx4:\\displaystyle \\sin(n\\pi)=0,\\qquad\\cos(n\\pi)=(-1)^n}}$","on":"個事"},{"do":"box","term":"bx4","on":"是偶"}],"t":[191520,206030]},{"show":["$\\displaystyle\\int_0^\\pi x^2\\cos x\\,dx$：表格得","$F(x)=x^2\\sin x+2x\\cos x-2\\sin x$"],"say":"例子：x 平方餘弦 x，從 0 到派。表格法得到反導函數：x 平方正弦，加 2x 餘弦，減 2 正弦。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle\\int_0^\\pi x^2\\cos x\\,dx$：表格得"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle F(x)=x^2\\sin x+2x\\cos x-2\\sin x$","on":"表格"},{"do":"write","line":"　右欄：$\\cos x,\\ \\sin x,\\ -\\cos x,\\ -\\sin x$","color":"violet","on":"2x"}],"t":[206030,220170]},{"show":["$x=\\pi$：所有 $\\sin$ 項都是 $0$，$\\cos\\pi=-1$","$F(\\pi)=0+2\\pi(-1)-0=-2\\pi$"],"say":"代派：有正弦的項全部是 0，只剩 2 派乘餘弦派，餘弦派是負 1，得到負 2 派。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$x=\\pi$：所有 $\\sin$ 項都是 $0$，$\\cos\\pi=-1$"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle F(\\pi)=0+2\\pi(-1)-0=-2\\pi$","on":"乘餘"}],"t":[220170,228790]},{"show":["$x=0$：$F(0)=0+0-0=0$"],"say":"代 0：每一項都有 x 或正弦 0，全部是 0。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$x=0$：$F(0)=0+0-0=0$"}],"t":[228790,234170]},{"show":["$\\int_0^\\pi x^2\\cos x\\,dx=-2\\pi-0=-2\\pi$"],"say":"答案是負 2 派。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx5:\\displaystyle \\int_0^\\pi x^2\\cos x\\,dx=-2\\pi-0=-2\\pi}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx5","color":"red","on":"派。"},{"do":"write","line":"　先看哪些項會被 $\\sin(n\\pi)=0$ 或 $x=0$ 消掉，邊界項就很好算","color":"violet","at":0.6666666666666666}],"t":[234170,238160]}]},{"title":"試一題","beats":[{"show":["$\\displaystyle\\int_0^\\pi x\\sin 2x\\,dx=$？（反導函數 $-\\tfrac12x\\cos2x+\\tfrac14\\sin2x$）"],"say":"試一題：x 正弦 2x，從 0 到派。","t":[238160,249290]}],"check":2},{"title":"試一題","beats":[{"show":["一般：","$\\int_0^\\pi x\\sin nx\\,dx=\\frac{(-1)^{n+1}\\pi}{n}$"],"say":"一般來說，x 正弦 n x 從 0 到派，等於 n 分之派，正負號跟著 n 交錯。之後學傅立葉級數會一直用到。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"一般："},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx6:\\displaystyle \\int_0^\\pi x\\sin nx\\,dx=\\frac{(-1)^{n+1}\\pi}{n}}}$","on":"到派"},{"do":"box","term":"bx6","on":"之派"},{"do":"write","line":"　反導函數 $-\\frac xn\\cos nx+\\frac1{n^2}\\sin nx$，在 $\\pi$ 代入 $\\cos n\\pi=(-1)^n$","color":"violet","on":"之後"}],"t":[249290,263920]}]},{"title":"不是單一個 $\\sin$、$\\cos$ 時","beats":[{"show":["$\\int x\\sin^2x\\,dx$：$\\sin^2x$ 不好積，先降次","$\\sin^2x=\\frac{1-\\cos2x}2$"],"say":"如果三角那一塊不是單一個正弦或餘弦，例如 x 乘正弦平方，先用半角公式降次。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\int x\\sin^2x\\,dx$：$\\sin^2x$ 不好積，先降次"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\sin^2x=\\frac{1-\\cos2x}2$","on":"乘正"}],"t":[263920,272520]},{"show":["$\\int x\\sin^2x\\,dx=\\frac{x^2}4-\\frac12\\int x\\cos2x\\,dx$"],"say":"拆成兩塊：x 除以 2 直接積，得到 4 分之 x 平方；剩下 2 分之 1 的 x 餘弦 2x，就是熟悉的分部積分。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int x\\sin^2x\\,dx=\\frac{x^2}4-\\frac12\\int x\\cos2x\\,dx$"}],"t":[272520,285420]},{"show":["$=\\frac{x^2}4-\\frac x4\\sin2x-\\frac18\\cos2x+C$"],"say":"x 餘弦 2x 積出來是 2 分之 x 正弦 2x 加 4 分之 1 餘弦 2x，乘上負 2 分之 1，就是這個答案。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx7:\\displaystyle =\\frac{x^2}4-\\frac x4\\sin2x-\\frac18\\cos2x+C}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx7","color":"red","on":"分之#2"}],"t":[285420,297620]},{"show":["同樣：$x\\sin x\\cos x=\\tfrac12x\\sin2x$（倍角）"],"say":"同樣的道理，x 正弦乘餘弦，先用倍角公式變成 2 分之 1 x 正弦 2x。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"同樣：$x\\sin x\\cos x=\\tfrac12x\\sin2x$（倍角）"},{"do":"write","line":"　原則：先把三角部分化成單一個 $\\sin(ax)$、$\\cos(ax)$，再分部","color":"violet","on":"式變"}],"t":[297620,306320]}]},{"title":"$dv$ 選積得出來的","beats":[{"show":["$\\int x\\sec^2x\\,dx$：$\\sec^2x$ 積得出來（$=\\tan x$）"],"say":"有時候三角部分不是正弦餘弦，但只要積得出來，一樣可以當 d v。例如正割平方，積分是正切。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\int x\\sec^2x\\,dx$：$\\sec^2x$ 積得出來（$=\\tan x$）"}],"t":[306320,317060]},{"show":["$\\int x\\sec^2x\\,dx=x\\tan x-\\int\\tan x\\,dx$"],"say":"讓 x 當 u，正割平方當 d v，v 是正切。代公式，剩下積分正切。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int x\\sec^2x\\,dx=x\\tan x-\\int\\tan x\\,dx$"}],"t":[317060,325290]},{"show":["$=x\\tan x+\\ln|\\cos x|+C$"],"say":"正切的積分是負的自然對數絕對值餘弦，減掉它就變成加。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx8:\\displaystyle =x\\tan x+\\ln|\\cos x|+C}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx8","color":"red","on":"自然"},{"do":"write","line":"　$\\int\\tan x\\,dx=-\\ln|\\cos x|+C$（換元 $w=\\cos x$）","color":"violet","on":"減掉"}],"t":[325290,332310]}],"check":3},{"title":"重點整理","beats":[{"show":["• $x^n\\sin ax$、$x^n\\cos ax$：多項式當 $u$，表格法","• 右欄循環：$\\sin\\to-\\cos\\to-\\sin\\to\\cos$，每次除以 $a$"],"say":"整理一下：多項式乘三角，多項式當 u，用表格法。右欄正弦餘弦循環，每次除以 a。兩組正負號都要乘。定積分代派的整數倍，正弦是 0，餘弦是正負 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"• $x^n\\sin ax$、$x^n\\cos ax$：多項式當 $u$，表格法"},{"do":"write","line":"• 右欄循環：$\\sin\\to-\\cos\\to-\\sin\\to\\cos$，每次除以 $a$","on":"式當"},{"do":"write","line":"• 兩組正負號：斜乘的 $+,-$，乘上右欄自己的號","on":"弦循"},{"do":"write","line":"• 定積分：$\\sin n\\pi=0$，$\\cos n\\pi=(-1)^n$","on":"負號"},{"do":"write","line":"• $\\sin^2$、$\\sin\\cos$：先降次；$\\sec^2$ 這類積得出來的也能當 $dv$","on":"正弦#2"}],"t":[351490,369380]},{"show":["下一課：$\\ln x$、反三角函數"],"say":"下一課，反過來：自然對數和反三角函數，要當 u 的是它們。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"下一課：$\\ln x$、反三角函數"}],"t":[369380,377861]}]}],"checks":[{"ask":"$\\displaystyle\\int x\\cos x\\,dx$ 用表格法，右欄依序是？","options":[{"label":"$\\cos x,\\ \\sin x,\\ -\\cos x$","correct":true},{"label":"$\\cos x,\\ -\\sin x,\\ -\\cos x$","why":"第一步把積分當成微分：$\\cos x$ 積分是 $+\\sin x$"},{"label":"$\\cos x,\\ \\sin x,\\ \\cos x$","why":"漏了 $\\sin x$ 積分出來的負號"}]},{"ask":"$\\displaystyle\\int x\\sin 3x\\,dx=$？","options":[{"label":"$-\\tfrac13x\\cos3x+\\tfrac19\\sin3x+C$","correct":true},{"label":"$-\\tfrac13x\\cos3x+\\tfrac13\\sin3x+C$","why":"第二格只除了一次 $3$，應該是 $\\frac19$"},{"label":"$-3x\\cos3x+9\\sin3x+C$","why":"積分要除以 $3$，不是乘以 $3$"},{"label":"$-\\tfrac13x\\cos3x-\\tfrac19\\sin3x+C$","why":"兩組負號只算了一組：$-1\\cdot(-\\frac19\\sin3x)$ 是正的"}]},{"ask":"$\\displaystyle\\int_0^\\pi x\\sin 2x\\,dx=$？（反導函數 $-\\tfrac12x\\cos2x+\\tfrac14\\sin2x$）","options":[{"label":"$-\\dfrac\\pi2$","correct":true},{"label":"$\\dfrac\\pi2$","why":"$\\cos2\\pi=1$，前面的 $-\\frac12$ 還在：結果是負的"},{"label":"$0$","why":"$\\sin$ 項是 $0$，但 $x\\cos2x$ 項在 $x=\\pi$ 不是 $0$"},{"label":"$-\\pi$","why":"漏了 $\\frac12$"}]},{"ask":"$\\displaystyle\\int x\\sec^2x\\,dx$ 為什麼要讓 $dv=\\sec^2x\\,dx$？","options":[{"label":"因為 $\\sec^2x$ 積得出來，而 $x$ 微分後變簡單","correct":true},{"label":"因為 $\\sec^2x$ 微分後變簡單","why":"$\\sec^2x$ 微分是 $2\\sec^2x\\tan x$，反而更複雜"},{"label":"因為 $\\sec^2x$ 永遠都要當 $u$","why":"這題 $\\sec^2x$ 是 $dv$，不是 $u$；而且沒有「永遠」的規則"}]}],"practice":[{"id":"hc-ibp-002","core":true},{"id":"hc-ibp-009","core":true},{"id":"burst-int-037","core":true},{"id":"cg-4d-006","core":true},{"id":"cg-4d-008","core":true},{"id":"burst-boss-anti-004"},{"id":"cg-4d-007"},{"id":"cg-4d-009"},{"id":"burst-boss-anti-003","challenge":true,"note":"挑戰：三次多項式 $\\times$ $\\sin 2x$，表格四列，兩組正負號都要算對。"},{"id":"burst-boss3-anti-003","challenge":true,"note":"挑戰：五次多項式，表格六列。"}]},"ibp-log-invtrig":{"id":"ibp-log-invtrig","prerequisites":["integration-by-parts","u-sub-recognize"],"next":["ibp-cyclic"],"related":["ibp-cyclic","derivative-log","inverse-trig-derivative"],"objectives":["會積單獨的 $\\ln x$、$\\arctan x$、$\\arcsin x$：令 $dv=dx$","$x^n\\ln x$、$x^n\\arctan x$ 會選 $\\ln$、$\\arctan$ 當 $u$","分部之後剩下的積分常要再換元或做代數變形，會接著做完"],"concept":[{"heading":"① 為什麼它們要當 $u$","body":["但它們的積分我們還不知道","所以分部時，它們一定當 $u$：","• 當 $u$：微分掉，剩代數式","• 當 $dv$：要先知道它的積分，卡住","跟上兩課相反：這次多項式當 $dv$","常見的優先順序「對、反、代、三、指」：越前面越優先當 $u$"],"tex":["\\begin{aligned}(\\ln x)'&=\\frac1x\\\\(\\arctan x)'&=\\frac1{1+x^2}\\\\(\\arcsin x)'&=\\frac1{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}\\end{aligned}"]},{"heading":"② 單獨一個：$dv=dx$","body":["$\\int\\ln x\\,dx$：只有一個函數，哪來的 $dv$？","看不見的 $dv=dx$：$u=\\ln x$","$x\\cdot\\frac1x=1$：剛好消掉","檢查：$(x\\ln x-x)'=\\ln x+1-1=\\ln x$","$\\arcsin x$ 一樣：","剩下的積分：換元 $w=1-x^2$，得 $-\\sqrt{1-x^2}$"],"tex":["du=\\frac1x\\,dx,\\qquad v=x","\\int\\ln x\\,dx=x\\ln x-\\int x\\cdot\\frac1x\\,dx","\\int\\ln x\\,dx=x\\ln x-x+C","\\int\\arcsin x\\,dx=x\\arcsin x-\\int\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}\\,dx","\\begin{aligned}\\int\\arcsin x\\,dx&=x\\arcsin x\\\\&\\quad+\\sqrt{1-x^2}+C\\end{aligned}"]},{"heading":"② 單獨的 $\\arctan x$","body":["$u=\\arctan x$、$dv=dx$：","分子 $x$ 是分母 $1+x^2$ 導數的一半：換元","$w=1+x^2$，$dw=2x\\,dx$：","$1+x^2>0$，不用絕對值","分部之後還沒完：剩下的常要換元或代數變形"],"tex":["\\int\\arctan x\\,dx=x\\arctan x-\\int\\frac{x}{1+x^2}\\,dx","\\int\\frac{x}{1+x^2}dx=\\frac12\\int\\frac{dw}{w}=\\frac12\\ln(1+x^2)","\\begin{aligned}\\int\\arctan x\\,dx&=x\\arctan x\\\\&\\quad-\\tfrac12\\ln(1+x^2)+C\\end{aligned}"]},{"heading":"③ 乘上 $x^n$","body":["$\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{\\ln x}{x^3}\\,dx=\\int x^{-3}\\ln x\\,dx$","$u=\\ln x$、$dv=x^{-3}dx$：","檢查：$\\big(-\\frac{\\ln x}{2x^2}\\big)'=\\frac{-1+2\\ln x}{2x^3}$，$\\big(-\\frac1{4x^2}\\big)'=\\frac1{2x^3}$，相加 $=\\frac{\\ln x}{x^3}$","一般（$n\\ne-1$）：","$n=-1$：$\\int\\frac{\\ln x}x\\,dx=\\frac12(\\ln x)^2+C$，換元就好"],"tex":["du=\\frac1x\\,dx,\\qquad v=-\\frac1{2x^2}","\\int\\frac{\\ln x}{x^3}dx=-\\frac{\\ln x}{2x^2}+\\int\\frac{1}{2x^3}\\,dx","=-\\frac{\\ln x}{2x^2}-\\frac1{4x^2}+C","\\int x^n\\ln x\\,dx=\\frac{x^{n+1}}{n+1}\\ln x-\\frac{x^{n+1}}{(n+1)^2}+C"]},{"heading":"④ 挑一個好用的 $v$","body":["$\\int x\\arctan x\\,dx$：$u=\\arctan x$、$dv=x\\,dx$","平常取 $v=\\frac{x^2}2$：新積分是 $\\displaystyle\\frac12\\int\\frac{x^2}{1+x^2}dx$，要先拆","改取 $v=\\dfrac{x^2+1}2$（也是 $x\\,dx$ 的反導函數）：","上一課說過 $v$ 的常數可以隨便挑，答案不變","用 $v=\\frac{x^2}2$ 也做得出來：$\\frac{x^2}{1+x^2}=1-\\frac1{1+x^2}$，結果只差常數","挑 $v$ 的常數，讓 $v\\,du$ 約分"],"tex":["\\int v\\,du=\\int\\frac{x^2+1}2\\cdot\\frac1{1+x^2}\\,dx=\\int\\frac12\\,dx","\\begin{aligned}\\int x\\arctan x\\,dx&=\\frac{x^2+1}2\\arctan x\\\\&\\quad-\\frac x2+C\\end{aligned}"]},{"heading":"⑤ 定義域","body":["• $\\ln x$：只在 $x>0$ 有定義","• $\\arcsin x$：$-1\\le x\\le1$，答案裡的 $\\sqrt{1-x^2}$ 也一樣","• $\\arctan x$：所有實數","定積分的區間要在定義域裡","例：$\\displaystyle\\int_1^e\\ln x\\,dx=\\Big[x\\ln x-x\\Big]_1^e$","$\\int_0^1\\ln x\\,dx$ 的下限 $0$ 不在定義域裡，要用瑕積分處理（之後會學）"],"tex":["=(e-e)-(0-1)=1"]},{"heading":"重點整理","body":["• $\\ln$、反三角：積分未知、微分乾淨 ⇒ 當 $u$","• 單獨一個：$dv=dx$，$v=x$","• $\\int\\ln x\\,dx=x\\ln x-x+C$","• $\\int\\arctan x\\,dx=x\\arctan x-\\frac12\\ln(1+x^2)+C$","• 分部後剩下的：換元、代數變形，接著做完","• 小技巧：挑 $v$ 的常數讓 $v\\,du$ 約分；注意定義域","下一課：重複分部與循環積分"]}],"workedExamples":[{"title":"單獨的 $\\ln x$","prompt":"$\\int \\ln x\\,dx$","problemId":"int-028","steps":["$u=\\ln x$，$dv=dx$。$du=\\frac{dx}{x}$，$v=x$。","$\\int \\ln x\\,dx=x\\ln x-\\int x\\cdot\\frac{1}{x}\\,dx=x\\ln x-\\int 1\\,dx$。","$=x\\ln x-x+C$。"],"answer":"$x\\ln x-x+C$"},{"title":"負次方 $\\times$ $\\ln x$","prompt":"$\\int \\frac{\\ln x}{x^3}\\,dx$","steps":["$u=\\ln x$，$dv=x^{-3}\\,dx$。$du=\\frac{dx}{x}$，$v=\\frac{x^{-2}}{-2}=-\\frac{1}{2x^2}$。","$\\int=-\\frac{\\ln x}{2x^2}-\\int \\left(-\\frac{1}{2x^2}\\right)\\cdot\\frac{1}{x}\\,dx=-\\frac{\\ln x}{2x^2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\int x^{-3}\\,dx$。","$\\frac{1}{2}\\int x^{-3}\\,dx=\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot\\left(-\\frac{1}{2x^2}\\right)=-\\frac{1}{4x^2}$。","答案：$-\\frac{\\ln x}{2x^2}-\\frac{1}{4x^2}+C$。"],"answer":"$-\\frac{\\ln x}{2x^2}-\\frac{1}{4x^2}+C$"},{"title":"單獨的 $\\arctan x$，接著換元","prompt":"$\\int \\arctan x\\,dx$","problemId":"exam-int-013","steps":["$u=\\arctan x$，$dv=dx$。$du=\\frac{dx}{1+x^2}$，$v=x$。","$\\int \\arctan x\\,dx=x\\arctan x-\\int \\frac{x}{1+x^2}\\,dx$。","剩下的是 $\\frac{u'}{u}$ 形狀（〈換元：辨識〉）：$\\int \\frac{x}{1+x^2}\\,dx=\\frac{1}{2}\\ln(1+x^2)$。","答案：$x\\arctan x-\\frac{1}{2}\\ln(1+x^2)+C$。"],"answer":"$x\\arctan x-\\frac{1}{2}\\ln(1+x^2)+C$"},{"title":"挑一個好用的 $v$","prompt":"$\\int x\\arctan x\\,dx$","problemId":"uni-int-012","steps":["$u=\\arctan x$，$dv=x\\,dx$。取 $v=\\frac{x^2+1}{2}$（也是 $x$ 的反導函數）。","$\\int x\\arctan x\\,dx=\\frac{x^2+1}{2}\\arctan x-\\int \\frac{x^2+1}{2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{1+x^2}\\,dx$。","剩下的積分是 $\\int \\frac{1}{2}\\,dx=\\frac{x}{2}$。","答案：$\\frac{x^2+1}{2}\\arctan x-\\frac{x}{2}+C$。"],"answer":"$\\frac{x^2+1}{2}\\arctan x-\\frac{x}{2}+C$"}],"pitfalls":["$\\int \\ln x\\,dx$ 讓 $dv=\\ln x\\,dx$，結果需要先會 $\\int \\ln x$，繞回原點。","$x^n\\ln x$ 讓 $u=x^n$：$dv=\\ln x\\,dx$ 積不出來。","分部之後剩下 $\\int \\frac{x}{1+x^2}\\,dx$，積成 $\\arctan x$。","$v=-\\frac{1}{2x^2}$ 這種負次方，代進公式時負號漏掉。"],"voice":"3be98562","sections":[{"title":"為什麼它們要當 $u$","beats":[{"show":["$\\begin{aligned}(\\ln x)'&=\\frac1x\\\\(\\arctan x)'&=\\frac1{1+x^2}\\\\(\\arcsin x)'&=\\frac1{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}\\end{aligned}$"],"say":"自然對數、反正切、反正弦，這三個函數有一個共同點：微分以後，變成很乾淨的代數式，對數和反三角都不見了。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle {\\begin{aligned}(\\ln x)'&=\\frac1x\\\\(\\arctan x)'&=\\frac1{1+x^2}\\\\(\\arcsin x)'&=\\frac1{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}\\end{aligned}}$"}],"t":[2980,15000]},{"show":["但它們的積分我們還不知道"],"say":"反過來，它們的積分是什麼，到目前為止我們都還不知道。積分表上沒有。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"但它們的積分我們還不知道","color":"red"}],"t":[15000,26290]},{"show":["所以分部時，它們一定當 $u$：","• 當 $u$：微分掉，剩代數式"],"say":"所以用分部積分的時候，它們一定當 u：讓它們被微分掉。如果拿去當 d v，就得先知道它的積分，正好卡住。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"所以分部時，它們一定當 $u$："},{"do":"write","line":"• 當 $u$：微分掉，剩代數式","on":"讓它"},{"do":"write","line":"• 當 $dv$：要先知道它的積分，卡住","on":"就得"}],"t":[26290,38420]}],"predict":{"ask":"$\\displaystyle\\int x\\ln x\\,dx$，誰當 $u$？","options":[{"label":"$u=\\ln x$，$dv=x\\,dx$","correct":true},{"label":"$u=x$，$dv=\\ln x\\,dx$","why":"要先知道 $\\int\\ln x\\,dx$；就算知道，新積分也更麻煩"},{"label":"都可以，結果一樣簡單","why":"選 $u=x$ 時新積分是 $\\int(x\\ln x-x)\\,dx$，又繞回原題"}]}},{"title":"為什麼它們要當 $u$","beats":[{"show":["跟上兩課相反：這次多項式當 $dv$"],"say":"注意這跟前兩課相反。前兩課多項式當 u；這一課，遇到對數和反三角，多項式讓位，去當 d v。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"跟上兩課相反：這次多項式當 $dv$"},{"do":"write","line":"　常見的優先順序「對、反、代、三、指」：越前面越優先當 $u$","color":"violet","on":"遇到"}],"t":[47680,59230]}]},{"title":"單獨一個：$dv=dx$","beats":[{"show":["$\\int\\ln x\\,dx$：只有一個函數，哪來的 $dv$？"],"say":"那只有自然對數 x 一個函數呢？看起來沒有東西可以當 d v。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\int\\ln x\\,dx$：只有一個函數，哪來的 $dv$？"}],"t":[59230,67710]},{"show":["看不見的 $dv=dx$：$u=\\ln x$","$du=\\frac1x\\,dx,\\qquad v=x$"],"say":"其實有一個看不見的 d v，就是 d x 本身。讓自然對數當 u，d x 當 d v，v 就是 x。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"看不見的 $dv=dx$：$u=\\ln x$"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle du=\\frac1x\\,dx,\\qquad v=x$","on":"自然"}],"t":[67710,78110]},{"show":["$\\int\\ln x\\,dx=x\\ln x-\\int x\\cdot\\frac1x\\,dx$"],"say":"代公式：x 乘自然對數 x，減掉 x 乘 x 分之 1 的積分。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int\\ln x\\,dx=x\\ln x-\\int x\\cdot\\frac1x\\,dx$"}],"t":[78110,86870]},{"show":["$x\\cdot\\frac1x=1$：剛好消掉","$\\int\\ln x\\,dx=x\\ln x-x+C$"],"say":"x 乘 x 分之 1 是 1，積分就是 x。答案是 x 自然對數 x 減 x 加 C。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$x\\cdot\\frac1x=1$：剛好消掉"},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx1:\\displaystyle \\int\\ln x\\,dx=x\\ln x-x+C}}$","color":"red","on":"積分"},{"do":"box","term":"bx1","color":"red","on":"答案"},{"do":"write","line":"　檢查：$(x\\ln x-x)'=\\ln x+1-1=\\ln x$","color":"violet","on":"C。"}],"t":[86870,97020]},{"show":["$\\arcsin x$ 一樣：","$\\int\\arcsin x\\,dx=x\\arcsin x-\\int\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}\\,dx$"],"say":"反正弦一樣做：d v 等於 d x，v 等於 x。剩下的積分是 x 除以根號 1 減 x 平方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\arcsin x$ 一樣："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int\\arcsin x\\,dx=x\\arcsin x-\\int\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}\\,dx$","on":"剩下"}],"t":[97020,108970]},{"show":["剩下的積分：換元 $w=1-x^2$，得 $-\\sqrt{1-x^2}$","$\\begin{aligned}\\int\\arcsin x\\,dx&=x\\arcsin x\\\\&\\quad+\\sqrt{1-x^2}+C\\end{aligned}$"],"say":"剩下的用換元：令 w 等於 1 減 x 平方，積出來是負根號 1 減 x 平方。減掉它，就變成加。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"剩下的積分：換元 $w=1-x^2$，得 $-\\sqrt{1-x^2}$"},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx2:\\displaystyle {\\begin{aligned}\\int\\arcsin x\\,dx&=x\\arcsin x\\\\&\\quad+\\sqrt{1-x^2}+C\\end{aligned}}}}$","on":"平方#1"},{"do":"box","term":"bx2","on":"平方#2"}],"t":[108970,122050]}]},{"title":"單獨的 $\\arctan x$","beats":[{"show":["$u=\\arctan x$、$dv=dx$：","$\\int\\arctan x\\,dx=x\\arctan x-\\int\\frac{x}{1+x^2}\\,dx$"],"say":"反正切也一樣：反正切當 u，d x 當 d v。剩下的積分是 x 除以 1 加 x 平方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$u=\\arctan x$、$dv=dx$："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int\\arctan x\\,dx=x\\arctan x-\\int\\frac{x}{1+x^2}\\,dx$","on":"剩下"}],"t":[122050,134760]},{"show":["分子 $x$ 是分母 $1+x^2$ 導數的一半：換元","$w=1+x^2$，$dw=2x\\,dx$："],"say":"分子 x，剛好是分母 1 加 x 平方的導數的一半。換元：w 等於 1 加 x 平方，積出來是 2 分之 1 自然對數 1 加 x 平方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"分子 $x$ 是分母 $1+x^2$ 導數的一半：換元"},{"do":"write","line":"$w=1+x^2$，$dw=2x\\,dx$：","on":"平方#1"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int\\frac{x}{1+x^2}dx=\\frac12\\int\\frac{dw}{w}=\\frac12\\ln(1+x^2)$","on":"平方#2"},{"do":"write","line":"　$1+x^2>0$，不用絕對值","color":"violet","on":"自然"}],"t":[134760,149660]},{"show":["$\\begin{aligned}\\int\\arctan x\\,dx&=x\\arctan x\\\\&\\quad-\\tfrac12\\ln(1+x^2)+C\\end{aligned}$"],"say":"合起來：x 反正切 x，減 2 分之 1 自然對數 1 加 x 平方，加 C。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx3:\\displaystyle {\\begin{aligned}\\int\\arctan x\\,dx&=x\\arctan x\\\\&\\quad-\\tfrac12\\ln(1+x^2)+C\\end{aligned}}}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx3","color":"red","on":"自然"}],"t":[149660,157860]},{"show":["分部之後還沒完：剩下的常要換元或代數變形"],"say":"這是這一課的常態：分部只是第一步，剩下的積分常常還要換元，或做一點代數變形。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"分部之後還沒完：剩下的常要換元或代數變形","color":"gold"}],"t":[157860,166840]}],"check":0},{"title":"乘上 $x^n$","beats":[{"show":["$\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{\\ln x}{x^3}\\,dx=\\int x^{-3}\\ln x\\,dx$"],"say":"再看乘上 x 的次方：自然對數 x 除以 x 三次方，也就是 x 的負 3 次方乘自然對數 x。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{\\ln x}{x^3}\\,dx=\\int x^{-3}\\ln x\\,dx$"}],"t":[177340,188720]},{"show":["$u=\\ln x$、$dv=x^{-3}dx$：","$du=\\frac1x\\,dx,\\qquad v=-\\frac1{2x^2}$"],"say":"自然對數當 u，x 的負 3 次方當 d v。積分是負 2 x 平方分之 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$u=\\ln x$、$dv=x^{-3}dx$："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle du=\\frac1x\\,dx,\\qquad v=-\\frac1{2x^2}$","on":"積分"}],"t":[188720,196920]},{"show":["$\\int\\frac{\\ln x}{x^3}dx=-\\frac{\\ln x}{2x^2}+\\int\\frac{1}{2x^3}\\,dx$"],"say":"代公式：u v 是負 2 x 平方分之自然對數 x；v 乘 d u，負號減掉變加，剩 2 x 三次方分之 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int\\frac{\\ln x}{x^3}dx=-\\frac{\\ln x}{2x^2}+\\int\\frac{1}{2x^3}\\,dx$"}],"t":[196920,209020]},{"show":["$=-\\frac{\\ln x}{2x^2}-\\frac1{4x^2}+C$"],"say":"2 x 三次方分之 1 積分，是負 4 x 平方分之 1。答案就是這樣。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx4:\\displaystyle =-\\frac{\\ln x}{2x^2}-\\frac1{4x^2}+C}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx4","color":"red","on":"積分"},{"do":"write","line":"　檢查：$\\big(-\\frac{\\ln x}{2x^2}\\big)'=\\frac{-1+2\\ln x}{2x^3}$，$\\big(-\\frac1{4x^2}\\big)'=\\frac1{2x^3}$，相加 $=\\frac{\\ln x}{x^3}$","color":"violet","on":"分之#2"}],"t":[209020,217840]},{"show":["一般（$n\\ne-1$）：","$\\int x^n\\ln x\\,dx=\\frac{x^{n+1}}{n+1}\\ln x-\\frac{x^{n+1}}{(n+1)^2}+C$"],"say":"一般的 x 的 n 次方乘自然對數，n 不等於負 1 時，都是這個樣子。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"一般（$n\\ne-1$）："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int x^n\\ln x\\,dx=\\frac{x^{n+1}}{n+1}\\ln x-\\frac{x^{n+1}}{(n+1)^2}+C$","on":"不等"}],"t":[217840,225440]},{"show":["$n=-1$：$\\int\\frac{\\ln x}x\\,dx=\\frac12(\\ln x)^2+C$，換元就好"],"say":"n 等於負 1 是例外：x 分之自然對數 x，自然對數的導數就在旁邊，直接換元，不用分部。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$n=-1$：$\\int\\frac{\\ln x}x\\,dx=\\frac12(\\ln x)^2+C$，換元就好"}],"t":[225440,235650]}]},{"title":"試一題","beats":[{"show":["$\\displaystyle\\int x\\ln x\\,dx=$？"],"say":"試一題：x 乘自然對數 x。","t":[235650,245660]}],"check":1},{"title":"試一題","beats":[{"show":["積 $x^n\\ln x$ 的步驟"],"say":"排排看步驟。","t":[245660,255270]}],"proof":true,"order":{"ask":"積 $x^n\\ln x$ 的步驟","steps":[{"label":"令 $u=\\ln x$，$dv=x^n\\,dx$"},{"label":"算 $du=\\frac1x\\,dx$，$v=\\frac{x^{n+1}}{n+1}$","why":"先要有上一步：令 $u=\\ln x$，$dv=x^n\\,dx$"},{"label":"代 $uv-\\int v\\,du$，新積分裡 $\\frac1x$ 跟 $x^{n+1}$ 約分","why":"先要有上一步：算 $du=\\frac1x\\,dx$，$v=\\frac{x^{n+1}}{n+1}$"},{"label":"積出 $\\int\\frac{x^n}{n+1}dx$，最後加 $C$","why":"先要有上一步：代 $uv-\\int v\\,du$，新積分裡 $\\frac1x$ 跟 $x^{n+1}$ 約分"}]}},{"title":"挑一個好用的 $v$","beats":[{"show":["$\\int x\\arctan x\\,dx$：$u=\\arctan x$、$dv=x\\,dx$"],"say":"再來一個小技巧。x 乘反正切 x：反正切當 u，x d x 當 d v。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\int x\\arctan x\\,dx$：$u=\\arctan x$、$dv=x\\,dx$"}],"t":[255270,263120]},{"show":["平常取 $v=\\frac{x^2}2$：新積分是 $\\displaystyle\\frac12\\int\\frac{x^2}{1+x^2}dx$，要先拆"],"say":"平常 v 取 2 分之 x 平方，新的積分是 x 平方除以 1 加 x 平方，還要先做除法拆開。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"平常取 $v=\\frac{x^2}2$：新積分是 $\\displaystyle\\frac12\\int\\frac{x^2}{1+x^2}dx$，要先拆"}],"t":[263120,275090]},{"show":["改取 $v=\\dfrac{x^2+1}2$（也是 $x\\,dx$ 的反導函數）：","$\\int v\\,du=\\int\\frac{x^2+1}2\\cdot\\frac1{1+x^2}\\,dx=\\int\\frac12\\,dx$"],"say":"技巧是：v 可以加任何常數，這裡故意取 2 分之 x 平方加 1。它剛好跟 d u 的分母約掉，只剩 2 分之 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"改取 $v=\\dfrac{x^2+1}2$（也是 $x\\,dx$ 的反導函數）："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int v\\,du=\\int\\frac{x^2+1}2\\cdot\\frac1{1+x^2}\\,dx=\\int\\frac12\\,dx$","on":"分之#1"},{"do":"write","line":"　上一課說過 $v$ 的常數可以隨便挑，答案不變","color":"violet","on":"的分"}],"t":[275090,287790]},{"show":["$\\begin{aligned}\\int x\\arctan x\\,dx&=\\frac{x^2+1}2\\arctan x\\\\&\\quad-\\frac x2+C\\end{aligned}$"],"say":"所以答案是 2 分之 x 平方加 1，乘反正切 x，減 2 分之 x，加 C。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx5:\\displaystyle {\\begin{aligned}\\int x\\arctan x\\,dx&=\\frac{x^2+1}2\\arctan x\\\\&\\quad-\\frac x2+C\\end{aligned}}}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx5","color":"red","on":"平方"},{"do":"write","line":"　用 $v=\\frac{x^2}2$ 也做得出來：$\\frac{x^2}{1+x^2}=1-\\frac1{1+x^2}$，結果只差常數","color":"violet","on":"分之#2"}],"t":[287790,295990]},{"show":["挑 $v$ 的常數，讓 $v\\,du$ 約分"],"say":"原則：v 的常數，挑一個能跟 d u 約分的。少做一次代數變形。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"挑 $v$ 的常數，讓 $v\\,du$ 約分","color":"gold"}],"t":[295990,308340]}]},{"title":"定義域","beats":[{"show":["• $\\ln x$：只在 $x>0$ 有定義","• $\\arcsin x$：$-1\\le x\\le1$，答案裡的 $\\sqrt{1-x^2}$ 也一樣"],"say":"最後注意定義域。自然對數只在 x 大於 0 有定義；反正弦只在負 1 到 1 之間，答案裡的根號也一樣；反正切則是全部實數。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"• $\\ln x$：只在 $x>0$ 有定義"},{"do":"write","line":"• $\\arcsin x$：$-1\\le x\\le1$，答案裡的 $\\sqrt{1-x^2}$ 也一樣","on":"有定"},{"do":"write","line":"• $\\arctan x$：所有實數","on":"答案"}],"t":[308340,321250]},{"show":["定積分的區間要在定義域裡"],"say":"所以算定積分的時候，上下限要整個落在定義域裡。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"定積分的區間要在定義域裡","color":"gold"}],"t":[321250,328540]},{"show":["例：$\\displaystyle\\int_1^e\\ln x\\,dx=\\Big[x\\ln x-x\\Big]_1^e$","$=(e-e)-(0-1)=1$"],"say":"例子：自然對數從 1 積到 e。代 e：e 減 e 是 0；代 1：0 減 1 是負 1。答案是 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"例：$\\displaystyle\\int_1^e\\ln x\\,dx=\\Big[x\\ln x-x\\Big]_1^e$"},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx6:\\displaystyle =(e-e)-(0-1)=1}}$","color":"red","on":"是負"},{"do":"box","term":"bx6","color":"red","on":"答案"}],"t":[328540,339840]},{"show":["從 1 到 e 的面積剛好是 1"],"say":"圖上，自然對數從 1 到 e 底下的面積，剛好是 1。","board":[{"do":"plot","nb":{"spec":{"id":"lnarea","window":[-0.2,3.2,-1.5,1.5],"fn":[{"expr":"ln(x)","color":"blue","label":"y = ln x","domain":[0.05,3.2]}],"area":[{"expr":"ln(x)","from":1,"to":2.718281828,"color":"blue"}],"vlines":[{"x":2.718281828,"label":"x = e","color":"pencil"}],"height":260}}},{"do":"write","line":"從 1 到 e 的面積剛好是 1","color":"violet","on":"底下"},{"do":"write","line":"　$\\int_0^1\\ln x\\,dx$ 的下限 $0$ 不在定義域裡，要用瑕積分處理（之後會學）","color":"violet","on":"面積"}],"t":[339840,345690]}],"check":2},{"title":"重點整理","beats":[{"show":["• $\\ln$、反三角：積分未知、微分乾淨 ⇒ 當 $u$","• 單獨一個：$dv=dx$，$v=x$"],"say":"整理一下：自然對數和反三角函數一定當 u；單獨一個時，d v 就是 d x。分部之後剩下的積分，常常還要換元。挑 v 的常數可以讓計算更乾淨。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"• $\\ln$、反三角：積分未知、微分乾淨 ⇒ 當 $u$"},{"do":"write","line":"• 單獨一個：$dv=dx$，$v=x$","on":"三角"},{"do":"write","line":"• $\\int\\ln x\\,dx=x\\ln x-x+C$","on":"一個"},{"do":"write","line":"• $\\int\\arctan x\\,dx=x\\arctan x-\\frac12\\ln(1+x^2)+C$","on":"分部"},{"do":"write","line":"• 分部後剩下的：換元、代數變形，接著做完","on":"常常"},{"do":"write","line":"• 小技巧：挑 $v$ 的常數讓 $v\\,du$ 約分；注意定義域","on":"的常"}],"t":[363920,379640]},{"show":["下一課：重複分部與循環積分"],"say":"下一課，分部好幾次，還有做兩次又繞回原題的循環積分。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"下一課：重複分部與循環積分"}],"t":[379640,387840]}]}],"checks":[{"ask":"$\\displaystyle\\int\\arcsin x\\,dx$ 分部後剩 $\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}dx$，它等於？","options":[{"label":"$-\\sqrt{1-x^2}+C$","correct":true},{"label":"$\\sqrt{1-x^2}+C$","why":"漏了 $dw=-2x\\,dx$ 的負號"},{"label":"$\\arcsin x+C$","why":"那是 $\\int\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}dx$；這裡分子多了 $x$"},{"label":"$-\\tfrac12\\sqrt{1-x^2}+C$","why":"$\\int w^{-1/2}dw=2\\sqrt w$，跟 $-\\frac12$ 相乘是 $-1$"}]},{"ask":"$\\displaystyle\\int x\\ln x\\,dx=$？","options":[{"label":"$\\dfrac{x^2}2\\ln x-\\dfrac{x^2}4+C$","correct":true},{"label":"$\\dfrac{x^2}2\\ln x-\\dfrac{x^2}2+C$","why":"$\\int\\frac x2\\,dx=\\frac{x^2}4$，不是 $\\frac{x^2}2$"},{"label":"$\\dfrac{x^2}2\\ln x+\\dfrac{x^2}4+C$","why":"公式是 $uv$ 減 $\\int v\\,du$，不是加"},{"label":"$x\\ln x-x+C$","why":"那是 $\\int\\ln x\\,dx$，少了 $x$"}]},{"ask":"$\\displaystyle\\int_0^1\\arctan x\\,dx=$？","options":[{"label":"$\\dfrac\\pi4-\\dfrac12\\ln2$","correct":true},{"label":"$\\dfrac\\pi4$","why":"只算了 $x\\arctan x$ 那一項"},{"label":"$\\dfrac\\pi4+\\dfrac12\\ln2$","why":"換元那一項前面是減號"},{"label":"$\\dfrac\\pi4-\\ln2$","why":"漏了換元的 $\\frac12$"}]}],"practice":[{"id":"int-009","core":true},{"id":"uni-int-011","core":true},{"id":"exam-int-004","core":true},{"id":"uni-int-003","core":true},{"id":"lec-07-q1d","core":true},{"id":"lec-07-q1c","core":true},{"id":"int-056","core":true},{"id":"cg-4d-010","core":true},{"id":"hc-ibp-007"},{"id":"burst-int-039"},{"id":"burst-boss-anti-007"},{"id":"cg-4d-011"},{"id":"world-050","challenge":true,"note":"挑戰：下限是 $0$，邊界項 $x^4\\ln x$ 在 $x\\to 0^+$ 的極限要自己算。"},{"id":"uni-int-004","challenge":true,"note":"挑戰：分部後剩下 $\\int \\frac{1}{x(1+x^2)}\\,dx$，要拆成部分分式。"},{"id":"world-082","challenge":true,"note":"挑戰：$(\\arcsin x)^2$ 要分部兩次，或先令 $x=\\sin\\theta$。"}]},"ibp-cyclic":{"id":"ibp-cyclic","prerequisites":["ibp-log-invtrig","ibp-poly-trig"],"next":["partial-fractions-linear"],"related":["reduction-formula","trig-integral-tan-sec"],"objectives":["會積 $(\\ln x)^n$：每分部一次，次方降一","會處理 $e^{ax}\\sin bx$、$e^{ax}\\cos bx$：分部兩次繞回原積分，再解方程式","知道循環型兩次分部要「同一邊當 $u$」，換邊會白做"],"concept":[{"heading":"① 重複分部：每次降一次","body":["上一課的做法：$u=(\\ln x)^2$、$dv=dx$","$x$ 約掉：剩 $2\\int\\ln x\\,dx$，次方降了一","$\\int\\ln x\\,dx=x\\ln x-x$（上一課）：","檢查：$\\big(x(\\ln x)^2\\big)'=(\\ln x)^2+2\\ln x$，$(-2x\\ln x+2x)'=-2\\ln x$","一般（遞迴公式）："],"tex":["\\int(\\ln x)^2\\,dx","du=\\frac{2\\ln x}{x}\\,dx,\\qquad v=x","\\int(\\ln x)^2dx=x(\\ln x)^2-\\int x\\cdot\\frac{2\\ln x}{x}\\,dx","\\begin{aligned}\\int(\\ln x)^2dx&=x(\\ln x)^2-2x\\ln x\\\\&\\quad+2x+C\\end{aligned}","\\int(\\ln x)^n dx=x(\\ln x)^n-n\\int(\\ln x)^{n-1}dx"]},{"heading":"① 試一題","body":["係數規律：$1,\\ -3,\\ 3\\cdot2,\\ -3\\cdot2\\cdot1$","也可以換元 $x=e^t$：$\\int t^3e^t\\,dt$，變成上一課的多項式 $\\times$ 指數"]},{"heading":"② 循環：原題又出現了","body":["誰當 $u$？微分、積分都不會變簡單","先試：$u=\\sin x$、$dv=e^xdx$","再做一次：$u=\\cos x$、$dv=e^xdx$","後面那個積分，就是 $I$"],"tex":["I=\\int e^x\\sin x\\,dx","I=e^x\\sin x-\\int e^x\\cos x\\,dx","\\int e^x\\cos x\\,dx=e^x\\cos x+\\int e^x\\sin x\\,dx"]},{"heading":"② 解方程式","body":["代回第一式：","把 $I$ 當未知數，移到左邊：","檢查：$\\big[\\frac{e^x}2(\\sin x-\\cos x)\\big]'=\\frac{e^x}2(\\sin x-\\cos x+\\cos x+\\sin x)=e^x\\sin x$"],"tex":["I=e^x\\sin x-\\big(e^x\\cos x+I\\big)","I=e^x\\sin x-e^x\\cos x-I","2I=e^x(\\sin x-\\cos x)","\\int e^x\\sin x\\,dx=\\frac{e^x}2(\\sin x-\\cos x)+C"]},{"heading":"③ 兩次要選同一邊","body":["第一次讓三角當 $u$，第二次如果改讓 $e^x$ 當 $u$：","代回第一式：","$I=I$：完全白做","原因：第二次換邊，就是把第一次反向做回去","規則：哪一邊當 $u$，兩次都一樣"],"tex":["\\int e^x\\cos x\\,dx=e^x\\sin x-\\int e^x\\sin x\\,dx","I=e^x\\sin x-\\big(e^x\\sin x-I\\big)=I"]},{"heading":"④ 解方程式為什麼合法","body":["$\\int e^x\\sin x\\,dx$ 是一群函數（差一個常數）","精確說法：取 $F$ 為任一反導函數，兩次分部給出","$F$ 是一個函數，可以移項：","唯一不行：$I$ 的係數變成 $0$","例如 $I=A+I$ 解不出 $I$；循環型做法要求兩邊係數不同","求出之後微分檢查，最保險"],"tex":["F=e^x\\sin x-e^x\\cos x-F+K","F=\\tfrac12e^x(\\sin x-\\cos x)+\\tfrac K2"]},{"heading":"④ 循環型的定積分","body":["$x=\\pi$：$\\tfrac{e^\\pi}2\\big(0-(-1)\\big)=\\tfrac{e^\\pi}2$","$x=0$：$\\tfrac12(0-1)=-\\tfrac12$","也可以直接在定積分上做兩次分部，邊界項一路帶著，結果一樣"],"tex":["\\int_0^\\pi e^x\\sin x\\,dx=\\Big[\\tfrac{e^x}2(\\sin x-\\cos x)\\Big]_0^\\pi","\\int_0^\\pi e^x\\sin x\\,dx=\\frac{e^\\pi+1}2\\approx12.07"]},{"heading":"⑤ 通用公式","body":["同樣做兩次（$a^2+b^2\\ne0$）：","檢查：$a=b=1$ 就是 $\\frac{e^x}2(\\sin x-\\cos x)$","例：$a=2$、$b=3$"],"tex":["\\int e^{ax}\\sin bx\\,dx=\\frac{e^{ax}(a\\sin bx-b\\cos bx)}{a^2+b^2}+C","\\int e^{ax}\\cos bx\\,dx=\\frac{e^{ax}(a\\cos bx+b\\sin bx)}{a^2+b^2}+C","\\int e^{2x}\\cos3x\\,dx=\\frac{e^{2x}(2\\cos3x+3\\sin3x)}{13}+C"]},{"heading":"⑤ 另一個循環例子","body":["$\\int\\sin(\\ln x)\\,dx$：$u=\\sin(\\ln x)$、$dv=dx$","再一次（同一邊）：$u=\\cos(\\ln x)$、$dv=dx$","換元 $x=e^t$ 後就是 $\\int e^t\\sin t\\,dt$，難怪會循環"],"tex":["I=x\\sin(\\ln x)-\\int\\cos(\\ln x)\\,dx","\\int\\cos(\\ln x)\\,dx=x\\cos(\\ln x)+I","I=x\\sin(\\ln x)-x\\cos(\\ln x)-I","\\begin{aligned}\\int\\sin(\\ln x)\\,dx&=\\frac x2\\big(\\sin(\\ln x)\\\\&\\qquad-\\cos(\\ln x)\\big)+C\\end{aligned}"]},{"heading":"重點整理","body":["• $(\\ln x)^n$：每分部一次降一次（遞迴公式）","• $e^{ax}\\sin bx$、$e^{ax}\\cos bx$：分部兩次，原題又出現","• 把原題當未知數 $I$，移項解出來，最後加 $C$","• 兩次要同一邊當 $u$；換邊得到 $I=I$，白做","• 通用公式分母 $a^2+b^2$；$\\sin(\\ln x)$ 也是循環型","下一課：部分分式"]}],"workedExamples":[{"title":"重複分部","prompt":"$\\int (\\ln x)^2\\,dx$","problemId":"int-013","steps":["$u=(\\ln x)^2$，$dv=dx$。$du=\\frac{2\\ln x}{x}\\,dx$，$v=x$。","$\\int (\\ln x)^2\\,dx=x(\\ln x)^2-\\int x\\cdot\\frac{2\\ln x}{x}\\,dx=x(\\ln x)^2-2\\int \\ln x\\,dx$。","$\\int \\ln x\\,dx=x\\ln x-x$。","答案：$x(\\ln x)^2-2x\\ln x+2x+C$。"],"answer":"$x(\\ln x)^2-2x\\ln x+2x+C$"},{"title":"循環積分","prompt":"$\\int e^x\\sin x\\,dx$","problemId":"int-015","steps":["令 $I=\\int e^x\\sin x\\,dx$。第一次：$u=\\sin x$，$dv=e^x\\,dx$。$I=e^x\\sin x-\\int e^x\\cos x\\,dx$。","第二次（三角還是當 $u$）：$u=\\cos x$，$dv=e^x\\,dx$。$\\int e^x\\cos x\\,dx=e^x\\cos x-\\int e^x(-\\sin x)\\,dx=e^x\\cos x+I$。","代回：$I=e^x\\sin x-(e^x\\cos x+I)=e^x\\sin x-e^x\\cos x-I$。","移項：$2I=e^x(\\sin x-\\cos x)$，所以 $I=\\frac{e^x(\\sin x-\\cos x)}{2}+C$。"],"answer":"$\\frac{e^x(\\sin x-\\cos x)}{2}+C$"},{"title":"循環型的定積分","prompt":"$\\int_0^\\pi e^x\\sin x\\,dx$","steps":["用上一題的反導函數 $\\frac{e^x(\\sin x-\\cos x)}{2}$。","代 $\\pi$：$\\frac{e^\\pi(0-(-1))}{2}=\\frac{e^\\pi}{2}$。","代 $0$：$\\frac{1\\cdot(0-1)}{2}=-\\frac{1}{2}$。","答案：$\\frac{e^\\pi}{2}-\\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)=\\frac{e^\\pi+1}{2}\\approx 12.07$。"],"answer":"$\\frac{e^\\pi+1}{2}$"}],"pitfalls":["循環型第二次分部換邊當 $u$，得到 $I=I$。","移項時把 $-I$ 當成消掉，而不是變成 $2I$。","解出 $I$ 之後忘了除以 $2$，或忘了 $+C$。","$(\\ln x)^n$ 的 $du$ 漏了連鎖律的 $\\frac{1}{x}$，或係數 $n$。"],"voice":"463ac75a","sections":[{"title":"重複分部：每次降一次","beats":[{"show":["$\\int(\\ln x)^2\\,dx$"],"say":"先看重複分部：自然對數 x 的平方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int(\\ln x)^2\\,dx$"}],"t":[2980,9270]},{"show":["上一課的做法：$u=(\\ln x)^2$、$dv=dx$","$du=\\frac{2\\ln x}{x}\\,dx,\\qquad v=x$"],"say":"照上一課的做法，整個自然對數平方當 u，d x 當 d v。u 微分用連鎖律，是 x 分之 2 倍自然對數 x；v 是 x。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"上一課的做法：$u=(\\ln x)^2$、$dv=dx$"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle du=\\frac{2\\ln x}{x}\\,dx,\\qquad v=x$","on":"微分"}],"t":[9270,22070]},{"show":["$\\int(\\ln x)^2dx=x(\\ln x)^2-\\int x\\cdot\\frac{2\\ln x}{x}\\,dx$"],"say":"代公式：x 乘自然對數平方，減掉 x 乘 x 分之 2 自然對數 x 的積分。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int(\\ln x)^2dx=x(\\ln x)^2-\\int x\\cdot\\frac{2\\ln x}{x}\\,dx$"}],"t":[22070,30970]},{"show":["$x$ 約掉：剩 $2\\int\\ln x\\,dx$，次方降了一"],"say":"x 剛好約掉，剩下 2 倍的自然對數 x 的積分。平方變成一次方，降了一次。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$x$ 約掉：剩 $2\\int\\ln x\\,dx$，次方降了一","color":"red"}],"t":[30970,41160]},{"show":["$\\int\\ln x\\,dx=x\\ln x-x$（上一課）：","$\\begin{aligned}\\int(\\ln x)^2dx&=x(\\ln x)^2-2x\\ln x\\\\&\\quad+2x+C\\end{aligned}$"],"say":"自然對數 x 的積分上一課做過，是 x 自然對數 x 減 x。代回去，乘負 2，就是答案。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\int\\ln x\\,dx=x\\ln x-x$（上一課）："},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx1:\\displaystyle {\\begin{aligned}\\int(\\ln x)^2dx&=x(\\ln x)^2-2x\\ln x\\\\&\\quad+2x+C\\end{aligned}}}}$","on":"一課"},{"do":"box","term":"bx1","on":"對數#2"},{"do":"write","line":"　檢查：$\\big(x(\\ln x)^2\\big)'=(\\ln x)^2+2\\ln x$，$(-2x\\ln x+2x)'=-2\\ln x$","color":"violet","on":"乘負"}],"t":[41160,52030]},{"show":["一般（遞迴公式）：","$\\int(\\ln x)^n dx=x(\\ln x)^n-n\\int(\\ln x)^{n-1}dx$"],"say":"一般來說，每分部一次，自然對數的次方就降一，前面多乘一個 n。這叫遞迴公式，一路降到 0 次方為止。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"一般（遞迴公式）："},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx2:\\displaystyle \\int(\\ln x)^n dx=x(\\ln x)^n-n\\int(\\ln x)^{n-1}dx}}$","on":"次方#1"},{"do":"box","term":"bx2","on":"遞迴"}],"t":[52030,64280]}]},{"title":"試一題","beats":[{"show":["用遞迴公式，$\\displaystyle\\int(\\ln x)^3dx=$？"],"say":"試一題：自然對數的三次方。","t":[64280,75560]}],"check":0},{"title":"試一題","beats":[{"show":["係數規律：$1,\\ -3,\\ 3\\cdot2,\\ -3\\cdot2\\cdot1$"],"say":"係數有規律：1，負 3，3 乘 2，負的 3 乘 2 乘 1。跟表格法一樣正負交錯。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"係數規律：$1,\\ -3,\\ 3\\cdot2,\\ -3\\cdot2\\cdot1$"},{"do":"write","line":"　也可以換元 $x=e^t$：$\\int t^3e^t\\,dt$，變成上一課的多項式 $\\times$ 指數","color":"violet","on":"跟表"}],"t":[75560,85830]}]},{"title":"循環：原題又出現了","beats":[{"show":["$I=\\int e^x\\sin x\\,dx$"],"say":"再來看一種完全不同的情況：e 的 x 次方乘正弦 x。把它叫做 I。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle I=\\int e^x\\sin x\\,dx$"}],"t":[85830,93250]},{"show":["誰當 $u$？微分、積分都不會變簡單"],"say":"誰當 u？e 的 x 次方怎麼微分積分都是自己；正弦怎麼微分積分都是正弦餘弦。兩個都不會變簡單。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"誰當 $u$？微分、積分都不會變簡單"}],"t":[93250,106310]},{"show":["先試：$u=\\sin x$、$dv=e^xdx$","$I=e^x\\sin x-\\int e^x\\cos x\\,dx$"],"say":"硬做做看：讓正弦當 u，e 的 x 次方當 d v。得到 e 的 x 次方正弦 x，減掉 e 的 x 次方餘弦 x 的積分。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"先試：$u=\\sin x$、$dv=e^xdx$"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle I=e^x\\sin x-\\int e^x\\cos x\\,dx$","on":"次方#2"}],"t":[106310,119810]}],"predict":{"ask":"對 $\\int e^x\\cos x\\,dx$ 再分部一次（$u=\\cos x$），會得到什麼？","options":[{"label":"原來的 $I$ 又出現了","correct":true},{"label":"積分消失，直接得到答案","why":"三角函數微分不會變 $0$，積分一直都在"},{"label":"一個更難的新積分","why":"微分 $\\cos$ 只會回到 $\\sin$，不會更難"}]}},{"title":"循環：原題又出現了","beats":[{"show":["再做一次：$u=\\cos x$、$dv=e^xdx$","$\\int e^x\\cos x\\,dx=e^x\\cos x+\\int e^x\\sin x\\,dx$"],"say":"再分部一次，餘弦當 u。餘弦微分是負正弦，負負得正，後面變成加上 e 的 x 次方正弦 x 的積分。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"再做一次：$u=\\cos x$、$dv=e^xdx$"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int e^x\\cos x\\,dx=e^x\\cos x+\\int e^x\\sin x\\,dx$","on":"後面"}],"t":[130770,141190]},{"show":["後面那個積分，就是 $I$"],"say":"注意後面那個積分：它就是原題 I。做兩次，繞回來了。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"後面那個積分，就是 $I$","color":"red"}],"t":[141190,150640]}]},{"title":"解方程式","beats":[{"show":["代回第一式：","$I=e^x\\sin x-\\big(e^x\\cos x+I\\big)$"],"say":"把它代回第一式：I 等於 e 的 x 次方正弦 x，減掉括號裡的 e 的 x 次方餘弦 x 加 I。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"代回第一式："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle I=e^x\\sin x-\\big(e^x\\cos x+I\\big)$","on":"減掉"}],"t":[150640,161040]},{"show":["$I=e^x\\sin x-e^x\\cos x-I$"],"say":"展開。右邊出現了負 I。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle I=e^x\\sin x-e^x\\cos x-I$"}],"t":[161040,166740]},{"show":["把 $I$ 當未知數，移到左邊：","$2I=e^x(\\sin x-\\cos x)$"],"say":"把 I 當成未知數，移到左邊，得到 2 倍的 I。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"把 $I$ 當未知數，移到左邊："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle 2I=e^x(\\sin x-\\cos x)$","on":"左邊"}],"t":[166740,172840]},{"show":["$\\int e^x\\sin x\\,dx=\\frac{e^x}2(\\sin x-\\cos x)+C$"],"say":"除以 2，最後補上常數 C。完全沒有真的去積它，是解方程式解出來的。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx3:\\displaystyle \\int e^x\\sin x\\,dx=\\frac{e^x}2(\\sin x-\\cos x)+C}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx3","color":"red","on":"完全"},{"do":"write","line":"　檢查：$\\big[\\frac{e^x}2(\\sin x-\\cos x)\\big]'=\\frac{e^x}2(\\sin x-\\cos x+\\cos x+\\sin x)=e^x\\sin x$","color":"violet","on":"是解"}],"t":[172840,181360]},{"show":["紅線的斜率，就是藍線的高度"],"say":"圖上，紅線是解出來的反導函數，它每一點的斜率剛好是藍線的高度。","board":[{"do":"plot","nb":{"spec":{"id":"exs","window":[-3,3.3,-6,13],"fn":[{"expr":"exp(x)*sin(x)","color":"blue","label":"eˣ sin x"},{"expr":"exp(x)*(sin(x)-cos(x))/2","color":"red","label":"反導函數"}],"height":220}}},{"do":"write","line":"紅線的斜率，就是藍線的高度","color":"violet","on":"它每"}],"t":[181360,191920]}]},{"title":"兩次要選同一邊","beats":[{"show":["第一次讓三角當 $u$，第二次如果改讓 $e^x$ 當 $u$：","$\\int e^x\\cos x\\,dx=e^x\\sin x-\\int e^x\\sin x\\,dx$"],"say":"如果第二次換邊，讓 e 的 x 次方當 u，餘弦當 d v 呢？得到 e 的 x 次方正弦 x，減掉 I。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"第一次讓三角當 $u$，第二次如果改讓 $e^x$ 當 $u$："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int e^x\\cos x\\,dx=e^x\\sin x-\\int e^x\\sin x\\,dx$","on":"得到"}],"t":[191920,204070]},{"show":["代回第一式：","$I=e^x\\sin x-\\big(e^x\\sin x-I\\big)=I$"],"say":"代回第一式：e 的 x 次方正弦 x 互相抵消，剩下 I 等於 I。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"代回第一式："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle I=e^x\\sin x-\\big(e^x\\sin x-I\\big)=I$","on":"互相"}],"t":[204070,211270]},{"show":["$I=I$：完全白做"],"say":"I 等於 I，這句話當然對，但什麼都沒解出來。第二次分部，等於把第一次的分部倒回去。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$I=I$：完全白做","color":"red"}],"t":[211270,221690]},{"show":["原因：第二次換邊，就是把第一次反向做回去"],"say":"原因是：第一次把 e 的 x 次方積分、正弦微分；第二次如果反過來，就剛好把第一次做的事還原。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"原因：第二次換邊，就是把第一次反向做回去"}],"t":[221690,231600]},{"show":["規則：哪一邊當 $u$，兩次都一樣"],"say":"所以規則是：第一次選三角當 u，第二次也選三角；第一次選指數當 u，第二次也選指數。兩種選法都可以，只是要一致。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"規則：哪一邊當 $u$，兩次都一樣","color":"gold"}],"t":[231600,244770]}],"check":1},{"title":"解方程式為什麼合法","beats":[{"show":["$\\int e^x\\sin x\\,dx$ 是一群函數（差一個常數）"],"say":"你可能會擔心：不定積分是一群函數，彼此差一個常數，可以這樣移項嗎？","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\int e^x\\sin x\\,dx$ 是一群函數（差一個常數）"}],"t":[255300,265080]},{"show":["精確說法：取 $F$ 為任一反導函數，兩次分部給出","$F=e^x\\sin x-e^x\\cos x-F+K$"],"say":"精確的說法是：取 F 是 e 的 x 次方正弦 x 的任何一個反導函數。兩次分部推出來的，是 F 等於這些項減 F，再加某個常數 K。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"精確說法：取 $F$ 為任一反導函數，兩次分部給出"},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx4:\\displaystyle F=e^x\\sin x-e^x\\cos x-F+K}}$","on":"的任"},{"do":"box","term":"bx4","on":"等於"}],"t":[265080,281060]},{"show":["$F$ 是一個函數，可以移項：","$F=\\tfrac12e^x(\\sin x-\\cos x)+\\tfrac K2$"],"say":"這時候 F 是一個確定的函數，可以放心移項、除以 2。常數 K 除以 2 還是常數，就是最後的加 C。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$F$ 是一個函數，可以移項："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle F=\\tfrac12e^x(\\sin x-\\cos x)+\\tfrac K2$","on":"常數#1"}],"t":[281060,291780]},{"show":["唯一不行：$I$ 的係數變成 $0$"],"say":"唯一會失敗的情況，是移項以後 I 的係數變成 0，也就是剛剛換邊得到的 I 等於 I。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"唯一不行：$I$ 的係數變成 $0$","color":"red"},{"do":"write","line":"　例如 $I=A+I$ 解不出 $I$；循環型做法要求兩邊係數不同","color":"violet","on":"也就"}],"t":[291780,300780]},{"show":["求出之後微分檢查，最保險"],"say":"最保險的方法：解出來以後微分一次，看是不是回到原函數。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"求出之後微分檢查，最保險"}],"t":[300780,308210]}]},{"title":"循環型的定積分","beats":[{"show":["$\\int_0^\\pi e^x\\sin x\\,dx=\\Big[\\tfrac{e^x}2(\\sin x-\\cos x)\\Big]_0^\\pi$"],"say":"循環型的定積分：先用解出來的反導函數，再代上下限。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int_0^\\pi e^x\\sin x\\,dx=\\Big[\\tfrac{e^x}2(\\sin x-\\cos x)\\Big]_0^\\pi$"}],"t":[308210,314760]},{"show":["$x=\\pi$：$\\tfrac{e^\\pi}2\\big(0-(-1)\\big)=\\tfrac{e^\\pi}2$"],"say":"代派：正弦派是 0，餘弦派是負 1，得 2 分之 e 的派次方。代 0：得負 2 分之 1。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$x=\\pi$：$\\tfrac{e^\\pi}2\\big(0-(-1)\\big)=\\tfrac{e^\\pi}2$"},{"do":"write","line":"$x=0$：$\\tfrac12(0-1)=-\\tfrac12$","on":"的派"}],"t":[314760,324360]},{"show":["$\\int_0^\\pi e^x\\sin x\\,dx=\\frac{e^\\pi+1}2\\approx12.07$"],"say":"相減，答案是 2 分之 e 的派次方加 1，大約 12.07。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"${{bx5:\\displaystyle \\int_0^\\pi e^x\\sin x\\,dx=\\frac{e^\\pi+1}2\\approx12.07}}$","color":"red"},{"do":"box","term":"bx5","color":"red","on":"派次"}],"t":[324360,331660]},{"show":["0 到 π 都在 x 軸上方，面積約 12.07"],"say":"圖上，從 0 到派，函數都在 x 軸上方，所以答案是正的，面積大約 12。","board":[{"do":"plot","nb":{"spec":{"id":"exsa","window":[-0.2,3.4,-1,9],"fn":[{"expr":"exp(x)*sin(x)","color":"blue","label":"eˣ sin x"}],"area":[{"expr":"exp(x)*sin(x)","from":0,"to":3.14159265,"color":"blue"}],"height":220}}},{"do":"write","line":"0 到 π 都在 x 軸上方，面積約 12.07","color":"violet","on":"都在"},{"do":"write","line":"　也可以直接在定積分上做兩次分部，邊界項一路帶著，結果一樣","color":"violet","on":"案是"}],"t":[331660,344360]}]},{"title":"通用公式","beats":[{"show":["同樣做兩次（$a^2+b^2\\ne0$）：","$\\int e^{ax}\\sin bx\\,dx=\\frac{e^{ax}(a\\sin bx-b\\cos bx)}{a^2+b^2}+C$"],"say":"對一般的 e 的 a x 次方，乘正弦 b x 或餘弦 b x，同樣做兩次，解出這兩個公式。分母是 a 平方加 b 平方。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"同樣做兩次（$a^2+b^2\\ne0$）："},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int e^{ax}\\sin bx\\,dx=\\frac{e^{ax}(a\\sin bx-b\\cos bx)}{a^2+b^2}+C$","on":"乘正"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int e^{ax}\\cos bx\\,dx=\\frac{e^{ax}(a\\cos bx+b\\sin bx)}{a^2+b^2}+C$","on":"同樣"},{"do":"write","line":"　檢查：$a=b=1$ 就是 $\\frac{e^x}2(\\sin x-\\cos x)$","color":"violet","on":"分母"}],"t":[344360,356960]},{"show":["例：$a=2$、$b=3$","$\\int e^{2x}\\cos3x\\,dx=\\frac{e^{2x}(2\\cos3x+3\\sin3x)}{13}+C$"],"say":"例如 e 的 2x 次方乘餘弦 3x：a 是 2，b 是 3，分母是 4 加 9 等於 13。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"例：$a=2$、$b=3$"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int e^{2x}\\cos3x\\,dx=\\frac{e^{2x}(2\\cos3x+3\\sin3x)}{13}+C$","on":"分母"}],"t":[356960,367460]}],"check":2},{"title":"另一個循環例子","beats":[{"show":["$\\int\\sin(\\ln x)\\,dx$：$u=\\sin(\\ln x)$、$dv=dx$","$I=x\\sin(\\ln x)-\\int\\cos(\\ln x)\\,dx$"],"say":"循環不只出現在指數乘三角。看正弦自然對數 x：讓它當 u，d x 當 d v。u 微分是餘弦自然對數 x 乘 x 分之 1，跟 v 等於 x 約掉。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\int\\sin(\\ln x)\\,dx$：$u=\\sin(\\ln x)$、$dv=dx$"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle I=x\\sin(\\ln x)-\\int\\cos(\\ln x)\\,dx$","on":"微分"}],"t":[379970,397070]},{"show":["再一次（同一邊）：$u=\\cos(\\ln x)$、$dv=dx$","$\\int\\cos(\\ln x)\\,dx=x\\cos(\\ln x)+I$"],"say":"再分部一次，一樣讓三角當 u。又繞回 I。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"再一次（同一邊）：$u=\\cos(\\ln x)$、$dv=dx$"},{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle \\int\\cos(\\ln x)\\,dx=x\\cos(\\ln x)+I$","on":"角當"}],"t":[397070,405510]},{"show":["$I=x\\sin(\\ln x)-x\\cos(\\ln x)-I$","$\\begin{aligned}\\int\\sin(\\ln x)\\,dx&=\\frac x2\\big(\\sin(\\ln x)\\\\&\\qquad-\\cos(\\ln x)\\big)+C\\end{aligned}$"],"say":"移項除以 2：2 分之 x，乘正弦自然對數減餘弦自然對數。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"$\\displaystyle I=x\\sin(\\ln x)-x\\cos(\\ln x)-I$"},{"do":"write","line":"${{bx6:\\displaystyle {\\begin{aligned}\\int\\sin(\\ln x)\\,dx&=\\frac x2\\big(\\sin(\\ln x)\\\\&\\qquad-\\cos(\\ln x)\\big)+C\\end{aligned}}}}$","color":"red","on":"分之"},{"do":"box","term":"bx6","color":"red","on":"乘正"},{"do":"write","line":"　換元 $x=e^t$ 後就是 $\\int e^t\\sin t\\,dt$，難怪會循環","color":"violet","on":"減餘"}],"t":[405510,411970]}],"proof":true,"order":{"ask":"循環積分的步驟","steps":[{"label":"把原積分叫 $I$，第一次分部"},{"label":"第二次分部，同一邊當 $u$","why":"先要有上一步：把原積分叫 $I$，第一次分部"},{"label":"看到 $I$ 又出現，代回第一式","why":"先要有上一步：第二次分部，同一邊當 $u$"},{"label":"移項解出 $I$，最後加 $C$","why":"先要有上一步：看到 $I$ 又出現，代回第一式"}]}},{"title":"重點整理","beats":[{"show":["• $(\\ln x)^n$：每分部一次降一次（遞迴公式）","• $e^{ax}\\sin bx$、$e^{ax}\\cos bx$：分部兩次，原題又出現"],"say":"整理一下：自然對數的次方，每分部一次降一次。指數乘三角，分部兩次原題又出現，把它當未知數解出來。兩次一定要同一邊當 u。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"• $(\\ln x)^n$：每分部一次降一次（遞迴公式）"},{"do":"write","line":"• $e^{ax}\\sin bx$、$e^{ax}\\cos bx$：分部兩次，原題又出現","on":"每分"},{"do":"write","line":"• 把原題當未知數 $I$，移項解出來，最後加 $C$","on":"乘三"},{"do":"write","line":"• 兩次要同一邊當 $u$；換邊得到 $I=I$，白做","on":"把它"},{"do":"write","line":"• 通用公式分母 $a^2+b^2$；$\\sin(\\ln x)$ 也是循環型","on":"兩次#2"}],"t":[429590,443900]},{"show":["下一課：部分分式"],"say":"分部積分到這裡告一段落。下一課，有理函數的積分：部分分式。","board":[{"do":"write","line":"下一課：部分分式"}],"t":[443900,453407]}]}],"checks":[{"ask":"用遞迴公式，$\\displaystyle\\int(\\ln x)^3dx=$？","options":[{"label":"$x(\\ln x)^3-3x(\\ln x)^2+6x\\ln x-6x+C$","correct":true},{"label":"$x(\\ln x)^3-3x(\\ln x)^2+C$","why":"只做了一次，$\\int(\\ln x)^2dx$ 還沒積"},{"label":"$x(\\ln x)^3-3x(\\ln x)^2+6x\\ln x+6x+C$","why":"最後一項：$-3\\cdot(+2x)=-6x$，正負號錯了"},{"label":"$\\tfrac14(\\ln x)^4+C$","why":"那是 $\\int\\frac{(\\ln x)^3}{x}dx$；這裡沒有 $\\frac1x$ 可以換元"}]},{"ask":"$\\int e^x\\cos x\\,dx$ 第一次取 $u=e^x$、$dv=\\cos x\\,dx$，第二次應該怎麼取？","options":[{"label":"$u=e^x$，$dv=\\sin x\\,dx$","correct":true},{"label":"$u=\\sin x$，$dv=e^x\\,dx$","why":"換邊了，會把第一次還原，得到 $I=I$"},{"label":"不用再分部，直接積","why":"剩下的 $\\int e^x\\sin x\\,dx$ 還是循環型，積不出來"}]},{"ask":"$\\displaystyle\\int e^x\\cos x\\,dx=$？","options":[{"label":"$\\dfrac{e^x}2(\\cos x+\\sin x)+C$","correct":true},{"label":"$\\dfrac{e^x}2(\\sin x-\\cos x)+C$","why":"那是 $\\int e^x\\sin x\\,dx$"},{"label":"$e^x(\\cos x+\\sin x)+C$","why":"解方程式時是 $2I$，要除以 $2$"},{"label":"$\\dfrac{e^x}2(\\cos x-\\sin x)+C$","why":"$\\cos$ 的公式裡是 $+b\\sin bx$"}]}],"practice":[{"id":"uni-int-010","core":true},{"id":"exam-int-012","core":true},{"id":"hc-ibp-006","core":true},{"id":"int-055","core":true},{"id":"burst-int-038","core":true},{"id":"cg-4d-012","core":true},{"id":"depth-int-006"},{"id":"burst-boss-anti-006"},{"id":"cg-4d-013"},{"id":"cg-4d-014"},{"id":"depth-int-009","challenge":true,"note":"挑戰：$\\sin(\\ln x)$ 也會循環，$dv=dx$。"},{"id":"hc-ibp-003","challenge":true,"note":"挑戰：多項式 $\\times$ $e^x\\sin x$，先處理 $e^x\\sin x$ 的循環，再處理多項式。"},{"id":"world-027","challenge":true,"note":"挑戰：上限是 $\\infty$，邊界項要用極限。"}]}});
